'Essential Micro Fleece Ladies','essential-micro-fleece-ladies-fle-01-or','Stay cozy and chic with Barron''s Essential Micro Fleece Ladies ¼ Zip! Featuring anti-pill, ultra-soft polyester, zippered pockets, and a sleek feminine fit, it’s your winter must-have that hugs you just right while keeping warmth locked in. Elevate your cold-weather style with comfort that lasts!','Barron','FLE-01-OR','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Galaxy Golfer Ladies','galaxy-golfer-ladies-glf-01-ya','Step up your golf game with the Galaxy Golfer Ladies shirt by Barron! Featuring moisture-wicking polyester, sleek tonal collar, and sublimated faded panels, it keeps you cool, comfy, and stylish all year long. Perfect fit, bold contrast buttons—because your swing deserves standout style!','Barron','GLF-01-YA','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Oxford Lounge Short Sleeve Mens','oxford-lounge-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-id','Meet the Barron Oxford Lounge Short Sleeve—your new go-to for all-year, office-ready style! Crafted from luxe 60/40 cotton-rich melange fabric, it’s comfy, classy, and proudly South African. Double-button mitred cuffs add a sharp touch. Elevate your business look with effortless cool!','Barron','SHI-02-ID','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Quest Long Sleeve Blouse Ladies','quest-long-sleeve-blouse-ladies-shi-02-jf','Step up your office game with the Barron Quest Long Sleeve Blouse! Chic stripes, double-button cuffs, and a flattering curved hem make workwear stylish and comfy. Crafted from breathable poly-cotton, it’s the perfect all-year corporate essential that turns heads and boosts confidence!','Barron','SHI-02-JF','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Barron Heavyweight Sweater','barron-heavyweight-sweater-swe-18-xk','Wrap yourself in the Barron Heavyweight Sweater—an oversized hoody with cozy brushed fabric, a snug fixed hood, and a roomy kangaroo pocket. Crafted from durable poly-cotton blend, it’s your winter warrior for warmth, style, and unbeatable comfort. Stay bold, stay warm, stay unstoppable!','Barron','SWE-18-XK','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Michigan Bodywarmer Mens','michigan-bodywarmer-mens-bod-01-mv','Stay warm and stylish with the Barron Michigan Bodywarmer! Lightweight, quilted, and fully lined, it boasts a sleek funnel neck and handy welt pockets. Perfect for casual winter days, this bold, breathable polyester jacket keeps you cozy without the bulk. Elevate your cold-weather game now!','Barron','BOD-01-MV','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Statement Stretch Pants Ladies','statement-stretch-pants-ladies-bot-01-nh','Step out in style with Barron''s Statement Stretch Pants! Crafted from a comfy poly-spandex blend, these flattering, flared-leg trousers flex with you all day. From office chic to night vibes, their easy-care, local South African design keeps you looking fierce year-round. Comfort and style? Yes, please!','Barron','BOT-01-NH','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Jasmine Blouse Ladies','jasmine-blouse-ladies-shi-02-kp','Meet the Jasmine Blouse by Barron: sleek polyester perfection with a chic mandarin collar, flirty front keyhole, and button. Flattering, sheer, and effortlessly corporate—this all-year essential elevates your office style with clean, simple lines that scream confidence and class!','Barron','SHI-02-KP','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Bush Shirt Long Sleeve Ladies','bush-shirt-long-sleeve-ladies-sho-02-oj','Meet the Barron Bush Shirt—your new outdoor BFF! Crafted from 100% breathable cotton twill, it boasts a feminine fit with shaped panels, adjustable cuffs, and durable double-needle finishing. Stylish metal buttons and handy chest pockets make adventure-ready chic effortless!','Barron','SHO-02-OJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('4-in-1 Jacket Mens','4-in-1-jacket-mens-jac-02-ae','Meet the Barron 4-in-1 Jacket Mens – your ultimate winter warrior! Lightweight, water and wind resistant with zip-off hood and reversible fleece warmt