trast details, and a sleek side seam twist—keeping you cool, comfy, and stylish on and off the course all year round. Tee off in bold confidence!','Barron','GLF-01-UT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Berlin Lounge Shirt Long Sleeve Mens','berlin-lounge-shirt-long-sleeve-mens-shi-02-nj','Step up your style game with the Berlin Lounge Shirt by Barron! Crafted from soft, breathable polycotton melange fabric, it features a sharp two-piece raised collar, contrast cuffs, and sleek chest pocket—perfect for all-year business flair that’s as bold as you are!','Barron','SHI-02-NJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Oxford Blouse Short Sleeve Ladies','oxford-blouse-short-sleeve-ladies-shi-02-hp','Step into style and comfort with the Barron Oxford Blouse! This cotton-rich, melange masterpiece features a chic raised collar, curved hem, and concealed buttons—perfect for all-year office glam. Feminine, flawless, and proudly South African—your new go-to power blouse awaits!','Barron','SHI-02-HP','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Haze Golfer Mens','haze-golfer-mens-glf-01-yq','Step up your game with the Barron Haze Golfer Mens shirt! Featuring bold spray-effect sublimation prints, moisture-wicking polyester, and a sleek fitted design, it''s your all-year, all-occasion golf essential that keeps you cool, stylish, and ready to conquer the course.','Barron','GLF-01-YQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Berlin Lounge Shirt Short Sleeve Mens','berlin-lounge-shirt-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-ni','Step up your style game with the Barron Berlin Lounge Shirt! Featuring a sharp two-piece raised collar, contrast buttons, and breathable polycotton melange fabric, it’s the perfect blend of comfort and bold office-ready flair. Dress sharp, feel unstoppable—all year round!','Barron','SHI-02-NI','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Griffin Jacket Mens','griffin-jacket-mens-jac-02-bv','Meet the Griffin Jacket Mens by Barron—lightweight, stylish, and packed with smart fe