ightweight poly-cotton gem keeps you comfy and confident all year. Perfect for casual flair with a corporate twist—fashion meets function flawlessly!','Barron','SHI-02-IU','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Longer Length Puffer Ladies','longer-length-puffer-ladies-jac-16-pr','Wrap up in Barron''s Longer Length Puffer Ladies jacket—your winter warrior! With cozy hand-stuffed padding, a sleek funnel collar, and storm-proof zip, it’s warmth meets style. Fully quilted and lined for ultimate comfort, this medium-weight polyester marvel keeps chills at bay while you conquer the cold boldly!','Barron','JAC-16-PR','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Focus Golfer Ladies','focus-golfer-ladies-glf-01-up','Swing in style with the Focus Golfer Ladies by Barron! This feminine-fit, moisture-wicking golf shirt features bold contrast colors, side slits, and safety stitching for all-day comfort and flair. Stay cool, look sharp, and own the course—every season, every casual game!','Barron','GLF-01-UP','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Ridge Stretch Chino Ladies','ridge-stretch-chino-ladies-bot-19-pf','nan','Barron','BOT-19-PF','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Breezeway Golfer Mens','breezeway-golfer-mens-glf-01-py','Step up your game with the Breezeway Golfer Mens by Barron! Rock the sporty two-tone style, moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, and comfy self-fabric cuffs. Perfect for casual all-year wear, this high-performance, easy-care shirt keeps you cool and sharp on and off the course!','Barron','GLF-01-PY','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Colton Stretch Chino Mens','colton-stretch-chino-mens-bot-01-nx','Step into comfort and style with Barron''s Colton Stretch Chino! Crafted from stretchy cotton-spandex, these chinos flex with you all day. With durable bar-tacked pockets and sleek flat-front design, they’re your go-to for business or chill—comfort meets bold sophistication!','Barron','BOT-01-NX','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Civic Blouse Short Sleeve Ladies','civic-blouse-short-sleeve-ladies-shi-02-hi','Step into confidence with the Barron Civic Blouse! Featuring a sleek raised collar, crisp corporate stripes, and a flattering curved hem, this poly-cotton blend keeps you sharp and comfy all day. Perfect for business or office vibes—style meets professionalism effortlessly!','Barron','SHI-02-HI','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Derby Golfer Mens','derby-golfer-mens-glf-01-ta','Step up your game with the Derby Golfer Mens by Barron! Featuring moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, tonal collar, and bold contrast piping, this easy-care, two-tone golf shirt keeps you cool, sharp, and ready to conquer the course all year round. Play active, look legendary!','Barron','GLF-01-TA','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Bentley Short Sleeve Jersey','bentley-short-sleeve-jersey-kni-02-eh','Meet the Bentley Short Sleeve Jersey by Barron—your new go-to pullover! Crafted from 100% polyester with a sleek V-neck rib and comfy set-in sleeves, it’s perfect for uniforms or everyday wear. Durable, stylish, and easy-care—just turn inside out to keep it looking fresh. Ready to upgrade your wardrobe?','Barron','KNI-02-EH','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Impact Golfer','impact-golfer-glf-01-si','Step up your game with the Barron Impact Golfer! Rock bold three-tone panels, moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, and comfy raglan sleeves. Stylish contrast details keep you looking sharp, while easy-care polyester means you’re always ready to swing—casual comfort meets pro-level performance!','Barron','GLF-01-SI','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Oliver Zip Off Cargo Pants Mens','oliver-zip-off-cargo-pants-mens-bot-01-nz','Meet the Oliver Zip Off Cargo Pants by Barron—your all-year, outdoor adventure buddy! With rugged poly-cotton fabric, zip-off legs for instant shorts, and pockets galore, these pants keep you ready, comfy, and unstoppable. Durable, versatile, and built to move with you—gear up and conquer!','Barron','BOT-01-NZ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Denver Denim Blouse Ladies','denver-denim-blouse-ladies-shi-02-ko','Meet the Denver Denim Blouse by Barron—your new all-year, casual fave! Crafted from 100% cotton dark denim with bold two-tone buttons, 3/4 sleeves, and flattering shaped hem, it’s style and comfort rolled into one. Turn heads with patch pockets and contrast stitching that screams effortless cool!','Barron','SHI-02-KO','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Cedar Lounge Short Sleeve Mens','cedar-lounge-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-lj','Step up your style game with the Barron Cedar Lounge Short Sleeve! Crafted from 100% comfy cotton with eye-catching check and contrast oxford trims, it’s your go-to for casual cool all year round. Pocket the perfect blend of comfort, style, and bold flair—wear it, own it!','Barron','SHI-02-LJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Scout Jacket','scout-jacket-jac-02-at','Meet the Barron Scout Jacket—your ultimate lightweight, water- and wind-resistant sidekick! With elastic cuffs, zip-away hood, and breathable Airtex mesh lining, it keeps you comfy and dry. Stylish side pockets with bar-tacking and adjustable hem make it perfect for casual winter adventures. Gear up and stand out!','Barron','JAC-02-AT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Padded Parka Mens','padded-parka-mens-jac-16-pt','Stay warm and stylish with the Barron Padded Parka Mens! Fully padded, fleece-lined hood, and storm flap keep winter chills at bay. Snap-closed pockets and elastic cuffs add convenience and comfort—perfect for executives who demand both function and flair. Winter just got a whole lot cooler!','Barron','JAC-16-PT','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Spirit Golfer Mens','spirit-golfer-mens-glf-01-sg','Step onto the green in style with the Spirit Golfer Mens by Barron! This moisture-wicking, all-year polyester golf shirt boasts a sharp matching collar, double contrast details, and a sleek concealed placket—keeping you cool, comfy, and confident on every swing!','Barron','GLF-01-SG','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Capri Jacket Mens','capri-jacket-mens-jac-01-zg','Meet the Barron Capri Jacket: your winter warrior! Water and wind-resistant with breathable, padded warmth, it’s built for comfort and style. Zip access for embroidery, sleek contrast panels, and handy side pockets make this medium-weight marvel a must-have for bold, cold-weather adventures!','Barron','JAC-01-ZG','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel')) AS v(name,handle,description,brand,item,features,category_slug) JOIN public.shop_categories c ON c.slug=v.category_slug ON CONFLICT (handle) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,description=EXCLUDED.description,brand=EXCLUDED.brand,supplier_item_number=EXCLUDED.supplier_item_number,product_features=EXCLUDED.product_features,category_id=EXCLUDED.category_id,status=EXCLUDED.status;
