'techno-jacket-ladies-jac-01-zn','Meet the Techno Jacket Ladies by Barron: your winter warrior! Lightweight, water and wind resistant, with 4-way stretch fleece for ultimate comfort. Zippered pockets keep essentials safe, while feminine styling and top-stitching make you look fierce. Ready to conquer cold in style? Absolutely!','Barron','JAC-01-ZN','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Techno Jacket Mens','techno-jacket-mens-jac-01-zt','Meet the Barron Techno Jacket Mens – your winter warrior! Lightweight, water and wind resistant, with 4-way stretch fleece for ultimate comfort. Zip up, stash your essentials, and conquer the cold in style with raglan flair. Adventure-ready, bold, and built to move with you!','Barron','JAC-01-ZT','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Edge Golfer Mens','edge-golfer-mens-glf-01-rw','Step up your game with the Edge Golfer Mens by Barron—lightweight, moisture-wicking polyester keeps you cool and dry, while bold contrast details and a sporty knitted collar deliver unmatched style and comfort all year round. Ready to ace casual looks on and off the course!','Barron','GLF-01-RW','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('5 Pocket Chino','5-pocket-chino-bot-01-nm','Step up your style game with Barron''s 5 Pocket Chino! Crafted from durable, soft poly-cotton twill, these tailored, relaxed-fit chinos boast double-stitched pockets, a sleek flat front, and rugged YKK zipper—perfect for business or office with unbeatable comfort and local pride!','Barron','BOT-01-NM','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Baxter Golfer Ladies','baxter-golfer-ladies-glf-01-so','Step up your game with the Baxter Golfer Ladies shirt by Barron! Featuring moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, a sleek slim fit, and stylish contrast details, it keeps you cool, comfortable, and looking fabulous on and off the course—perfect for year-round play and unbeatable style!','Barron','GLF-01-SO','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Felton Golfer Mens','felton-golfer-mens-glf-01-st','Step up your game with the Felton Golfer Mens by Barron! Rock moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, bold contrast details, and a comfy raglan fit that keeps you cool and sharp all day. Easy-care, stylish, and built for champions—this golf shirt is your ultimate uniform upgrade!','Barron','GLF-01-ST','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Harvard Hoody Mens','harvard-hoody-mens-swe-02-pg','Meet the Harvard Hoody Mens by Barron—your heavyweight winter warrior with cozy cotton-rich fleece, bold urban-collegiate style, and handy kangaroo pockets. Contrast zips and chunky drawcords add flair while raglan sleeves ensure freedom to move. Stay warm, look sharp, and own the season!','Barron','SWE-02-PG','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Unity Check Lounge Short Sleeve','unity-check-lounge-short-sleeve-shi-02-kd','Step up your casual game with the Barron Unity Check Lounge Short Sleeve! Crafted from 100% breathable cotton, its trendy check pattern, patch pocket, and curved hem deliver style and comfort all year round. Perfect for relaxed vibes with a sharp edge—wear it, own it!','Barron','SHI-02-KD','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Evoke Jacket','evoke-jacket-jac-02-aw','Meet the Barron Evoke Jacket: your lightweight, stretchy winter warrior! With water and wind resistance, breathable 4-way stretch polyester, and sleek zippered pockets, it’s designed to keep you comfy and stylish no matter the weather. Ready to conquer winter in bold comfort? Evoke it!','Barron','JAC-02-AW','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Huxley Jacket','huxley-jacket-jac-02-bb','Meet the Huxley Jacket by Barron—your sleek, lightweight armor with velcro-tabbed sleeves, zip-secure pockets, and a textured, top-stitched design. Crafted from stretchy polyester blend, it’s the executive’s go-to for style, comfort, and unbeatable surface flair!','Barron','JAC-02-BB','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Derby Golfer Ladies','derby-golfer-ladies-glf-01-tb','Step up your game with the Derby Golfer Ladies by Barron! Rock the two-tone style, moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, and comfy tapered fit—all year round. Easy care, bold contrast piping, and a sleek knitted collar make every swing stylish and effortless. Tee off in confidence and flair!','Barron','GLF-01-TB','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Geneva Blouse Ladies','geneva-blouse-ladies-shi-02-kg','Step into confidence with the Geneva Blouse by Barron! Ultra-soft, stretchy poly-spandex hugs your curves perfectly, while chic two-piece collar and high-low hem turn heads. Business meets bold—comfort and style that work all year, every day. Elevate your office game effortlessly!','Barron','SHI-02-KG','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel')) AS v(name,handle,description,brand,item,features,category_slug) JOIN public.shop_categories c ON c.slug=v.category_slug ON CONFLICT (handle) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,description=EXCLUDED.description,brand=EXCLUDED.brand,supplier_item_number=EXCLUDED.supplier_item_number,product_features=EXCLUDED.product_features,category_id=EXCLUDED.category_id,status=EXCLUDED.status;
INSERT INTO public.shop_products (title,handle,description,brand,supplier_item_number,product_features,category_id,base_price,currency_code,collection,status,position) SELECT v.name,v.handle,v.description,v.brand,v.item,v.features,c.id,0,'ZAR','corporate','published',0 FROM (VALUES ('Vitality Golfer Mens','vitality-golfer-mens-glf-01-uf','Elevate your game with the Vitality Golfer Mens by Barron! Lightweight, moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric keeps you cool and dry, while the bold two-piece collar and peep-out sleeve detail add flair. All-year comfort meets standout style—because you deserve to play and look your best!','Barron','GLF-01-UF','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Eve Stretch Jeans Ladies','eve-stretch-jeans-ladies-bot-01-np','Step into style and comfort with Barron''s Eve Stretch Jeans! Crafted from stretchy cotton-spandex, these flattering straight-leg jeans hug every curve perfectly. Durable rivets, sleek profile stitching, and versatile pockets make them your go-to for casual, all-year wear. Stretch your style limits—comfort never looked this good!','Barron','BOT-01-NP','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Focus Golfer Mens','focus-golfer-mens-glf-01-ul','Elevate your game with the Focus Golfer Mens by Barron! This bold, two-tone golf shirt features moisture-wicking e-Dri polyester, contrast accents, and a handy loose pocket—keeping you cool, stylish, and ready for every swing, all year round. Tee off in confidence and flair!','Barron','GLF-01-UL','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Solo Golfer Mens','solo-golfer-mens-glf-01-um','Step up your game with the Solo Golfer Mens by Barron! Featuring moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, contrast details, and a comfy knitted rib collar, this all-year golf shirt keeps you cool, stylish, and ready to swing—whether on the course or casual days out. Play bold, play fresh!','Barron','GLF-01-UM','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Illusion Jacket Ladies','illusion-jacket-ladies-jac-02-bs','Meet the Illusion Jacket Ladies by Barron: your winter warrior! Lightweight, stretchy soft-shell with cozy fleece lining, zip-off hood, and secure zip pockets. Sleek feminine cut and velcro sleeves keep you stylish and snug—perfect for conquering chilly days with flair and comfort!','Barron','JAC-02-BS','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Tulip Blouse Ladies','tulip-blouse-ladies-shi-02-mb','Step into style and confidence with the Tulip Blouse Ladies by Barron! Featuring a chic double-layer front and collar, ¾ sleeves with buttoned gauntlets, and a feminine fit that flatters every curve—this sheer, all-year polyester beauty is your ultimate office power move!','Barron','SHI-02-MB','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Cooper Jacket Mens','cooper-jacket-mens-jac-02-ca','Meet the Barron Cooper Jacket: your winter warrior! Padded warmth, zippered pockets, and a removable hood with adjustable cuffs keep you cozy, secure, and stylish. Plus, an inner cell phone pocket means your essentials stay close. Ready to conquer cold days with bold comfort? This jacket’s got you covered!','Barron','JAC-02-CA','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Cooper Jacket Ladies','cooper-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cb','Meet the Cooper Jacket Ladies by Barron—your winter warrior! With padded warmth, zippered pockets, a removable hood, and a secret inner cell phone pocket, it’s cozy, practical, and stylish. Adjustable cuffs and bold contrast details make it the ultimate cold-weather companion. Stay warm, sleek, and ready for anything!','Barron','JAC-02-CB','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Rochfort Jacket Mens','rochfort-jacket-mens-jac-02-cd','Meet the Rochfort Jacket by Barron – your winter warrior with cozy diamond quilting, a sleek funnel neck, and handy welt pockets. This medium-weight, fully lined polyester gem keeps you warm, stylish, and ready for any casual adventure. Zip up and stand out with bold comfort!','Barron','JAC-02-CD','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Rochfort Jacket Ladies','rochfort-jacket-ladies-jac-02-ce','Stay cozy and stylish with the Rochfort Jacket Ladies by Barron! Featuring diamond quilting, a sleek funnel neck, and comfy padded warmth, this medium-weight jacket keeps you snug and chic all winter. With handy welt pockets and a trendy curved hem, it’s your go-to for casual cool vibes!','Barron','JAC-02-CE','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Canyon Jacket Ladies','canyon-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cg','Meet the Canyon Jacket Ladies by Barron – your lightweight winter warrior! Crafted from durable 215g polyester with elasticated sleeves and storm flap, it keeps you cozy and stylish. Tough welt pockets and a sleek full zip mean functionality meets flair. Stay bold, warm, and unstoppable!','Barron','JAC-02-CG','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel'),('Stretch Cargo Pants Ladies','stretch-cargo-pants-ladies-bot-01-nu','Step up your style game with Barron''s Stretch Cargo Pants for ladies! Featuring stretchy, comfy cotton-rich fabric, smart cargo pockets with secure velcro flaps, and a sleek tapered leg—these versatile pants keep you chic and ready for business or play, all year round. Proudly South African and effortlessly bold!','Barron','BOT-01-NU','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel'),('Maxima Golfer Mens','maxima-golfer-mens-glf-01-xf','Step up your style game with the Maxima Golfer Mens by Barron! Rock the unique two-tone panels, comfy poly-cotton blend, and cool raglan sleeves. Perfect for casual days, this breathable, durable shirt keeps you sharp and ready to conquer—on or off the course!','Barron','GLF-01-XF','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Pegasus Jacket Ladies','pegasus-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cj','Unleash your bold side with the Barron Pegasus Jacket! This fitted ladies'' soft shell rocks breathable, water- and wind-resistant poly spandex, laser-cut pockets, and adjustable sleeves. Sleek two-tone contrast panels and a funnel neck collar keep you stylish and unstoppable all winter long!','Barron','JAC-02-CJ','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Melbourne Jacket Mens','melbourne-jacket-mens-jac-02-ck','Meet the Melbourne Jacket Mens by Barron—your winter warrior! With quilted ultra-soft padding, 4-way stretch softshell sleeves, and sleek hybrid style, it’s cozy, flexible, and fierce. Zip up, stay warm, and conquer the cold in bold, breathable comfort!','Barron','JAC-02-CK','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Colorado Jacket Mens','colorado-jacket-mens-jac-02-cm','Meet the Colorado Jacket Mens by Barron: a bold blend of melange style and rugged durability! Fully lined, padded, and quilted for ultimate winter warmth, with contrast zips and slanted pockets built to last. Stay cozy, look sharp, and conquer the cold in style!','Barron','JAC-02-CM','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Urban Stretch Jeans Ladies','urban-stretch-jeans-ladies-bot-01-nw','Step into comfort and style with Barron''s Urban Stretch Jeans! Crafted from stretchy cotton-poly blend, these straight-leg wonders hug your curves while giving you all-day freedom. With classic pockets and sleek profile stitching, they''re your go-to for casual cool—any season, any vibe!','Barron','BOT-01-NW','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Nevada Jacket Mens','nevada-jacket-mens-jac-02-co','Meet the Barron Nevada Jacket: your winter warrior with a sleek funnel collar, zip-off hood, and bold two-tone soft-shell fabric. Stay cozy, stylish, and ready for anything with adjustable sleeves, secure pockets, and a sharp curved hem. Winter just got an upgrade—grab yours and own the cold!','Barron','JAC-02-CO','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Orlando Jacket Mens','orlando-jacket-mens-jac-02-cq','Meet the Orlando Jacket Mens by Barron: your ultimate winter wingman! This urban bomber rocks a sleek mandarin collar, cozy quilted padding, and snap-secured pockets for style and security. Lightweight yet warm, it’s designed to keep you comfy and sharp—ready to conquer casual days with bold confidence!','Barron','JAC-02-CQ','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Orlando Jacket Ladies','orlando-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cr','Meet the Orlando Jacket Ladies by Barron—a winter-ready, urban bomber with a sleek mandarin collar, cozy rib-knit cuffs, and quilted padding for warmth. Snap into style with metallic closures and zip pockets that keep your essentials secure. Casual comfort just got a bold upgrade!','Barron','JAC-02-CR','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Nashville 3-in-1 Jacket Mens','nashville-3-in-1-jacket-mens-jac-02-cs','Meet the Barron Nashville 3-in-1 Jacket—your ultimate winter warrior! Water and wind resistant with a removable fleece inner, adjustable fit, and a fold-away hood. Rock it as one jacket or two—versatility and style that keep you warm, dry, and looking sharp no matter the weather!','Barron','JAC-02-CS','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Nashville 3-in-1 Jacket Ladies','nashville-3-in-1-jacket-ladies-jac-02-ct','Meet the Nashville 3-in-1 Jacket by Barron – your winter warrior! Water and wind resistant, with a removable fleece for triple the style and warmth. Rock the sleek hood, adjustable fit, and cozy pockets. Versatility and comfort? Absolutely nailed! Stay bold, stay warm, and conquer winter your way!','Barron','JAC-02-CT','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Finch Jacket Ladies','finch-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cw','Meet the Finch Jacket Ladies by Barron – your winter warrior! With wind-resistant, medium-weight soft shell fabric, a flattering fit, and concealed zippered pockets, it’s stylish and functional. Bonus: five colorful zip pullers to match your mood. Stay cozy, chic, and unstoppable this season!','Barron','JAC-02-CW','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel'),('Ava Stretch Skirt Ladies','ava-stretch-skirt-ladies-bot-01-ny','Step out in style with the Ava Stretch Skirt by Barron! Crafted from comfy cotton-spandex blend with stretch for all-day ease, it features sleek seams, handy pockets, and a flattering fit that moves with you—perfect for of