fident all day. Easy care, bold design—perfect for casual wear on or off the course!','Barron','GLF-01-RV','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Barista Blouse Long Sleeve Ladies','barista-blouse-long-sleeve-ladies-shi-02-ji','Step up your hospitality game with Barron''s Barista Blouse! This lightweight, poly-cotton beauty boasts a flattering fit, double-button cuffs, and a chic mandarin collar—perfect for stylish waitrons who mean business. Proudly South African and designed for comfort, it’s your new go-to for effortless elegance!','Barron','SHI-02-JI','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Denver Denim Shirt Short Sleeve Mens','denver-denim-shirt-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-jt','Meet the Denver Denim Shirt by Barron—crafted from ultra-comfy 100% cotton dark denim with bold contrast stitching and a sharp button-down collar. Lightweight yet durable, it’s your all-year casual essential that’s as stylish as it is breathable. Denim done right, just for you!','Barron','SHI-02-JT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Spirit Golfer Ladies','spirit-golfer-ladies-glf-01-sh','Step up your game with the Spirit Golfer Ladies by Barron! This sporty, two-tone golf shirt features moisture-wicking e-Dri fabric, a chic contrast collar, and sleek piping—keeping you cool, comfy, and stylish on and off the course all year round. Swing in confidence and flair!','Barron','GLF-01-SH','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Retro Jean Mens','retro-jean-mens-bot-01-nn','Step into timeless style with Barron''s Retro Jean Mens! Crafted from comfy cotton-rich fabric, these straight-leg jeans rock subtle sandblast and faded creases for that effortlessly cool vibe. Durable riveted pockets and bold contrast stitching make every casual day a fashion win!','Barron','BOT-01-NN','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Unity Check Lounge Long Sleeve','unity-check-lounge-long-sleeve-shi-02-kc','Step up your casual game with the Unity Check Lounge Long Sleeve by Barron! Crafted from 100% soft cotton, its trendy check pattern, patch pocket, and double-button cuffs deliver style and comfort all year round. Perfectly curved hem and back neck yoke make lounging look effortlessly cool!','Barron','SHI-02-KC','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Omega Golfer Mens','omega-golfer-mens-glf-01-tk','Step up your game with the Omega Golfer Mens by Barron! This bold, two-tone, moisture-wicking polo boasts a sleek shoulder panel and comfy cover-seam hem. Perfect for casual all-year wear, it’s your go-to for style, comfort, and unbeatable performance on and off the course!','Barron','GLF-01-TK','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Pulse Golfer Ladies','pulse-golfer-ladies-glf-01-tv','Swing in style with the Barron Pulse Golfer Ladies! Featuring a sleek two-piece collar, elegant shaped waist, and breathable polyspun fabric, this bold golf shirt keeps you comfy and sharp all year. Contrast checks and side slits add flair—perfect for turning heads on and off the course!','Barron','GLF-01-TV','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Stark Golfer Mens','stark-golfer-mens-glf-01-ty','Step up your game with the Stark Golfer Mens by Barron! Crafted from soft, breathable 60/40 cotton-rich fabric, this melange marvel features a sleek knitted rib collar, contrast piping, and a handy loose pocket—perfect for style and function on and off the course.','Barron','GLF-01-TY','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Stark Golfer Ladies','stark-golfer-ladies-glf-01-tz','Step up your game with the Stark Golfer Ladies by Barron! Crafted from soft, breathable 60/40 cotton-rich fabric with chic melange style, it features a sleek knitted rib collar, contrast piping, and an inverted zip placket for sporty flair and ultimate comfort all year round.','Barron','GLF-01-TZ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Vitality Golfer Ladies','vitality-golfer-ladies-glf-01-ug','Step up your game with the Vitality Golfer Ladies by Barron! Lightweight, moisture-wicking polyester keeps you cool and