ored, classic pull-on design, front slanted pockets, and a back elasticated waistband for all-day ease. Made from durable 100% polyester, these proudly South African pants are your year-round uniform upgrade!','Barron','BOT-01-NR','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Kelsey Cardigan Ladies','kelsey-cardigan-ladies-kni-02-ei','Wrap yourself in cozy elegance with the Kelsey Cardigan by Barron! Featuring a sleek ribbed neckline, tonal buttons, and comfy acrylic knit, it’s perfect for winter uniform wear. Stylish, warm, and effortlessly chic—turn heads while staying snug all season long!','Barron','KNI-02-EI','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Vega Golfer Mens','vega-golfer-mens-glf-01-vx','Step onto the green in style with the Vega Golfer Mens by Barron! This bold polyester polo boasts moisture management, contrast printed panels, and a sleek self-fabric collar—keeping you cool, sharp, and ready to crush every casual round, all year long!','Barron','GLF-01-VX','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Maxima Golfer Ladies','maxima-golfer-ladies-glf-01-xg','Step up your style game with the Maxima Golfer Ladies by Barron! Rock the unique two-tone panel design, comfy poly-cotton fabric, and feminine cut—perfect for casual days on or off the course. Side slits and raglan sleeves mean freedom to swing and shine all year round!','Barron','GLF-01-XG','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Colorado Jacket Ladies','colorado-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cn','Meet the Colorado Jacket Ladies by Barron – your winter warrior! With cozy padding, durable slanted pockets, and a bold dual-fabric design, it’s warmth and style rolled into one. Stay comfy, look sharp, and conquer the cold with this standout jacket!','Barron','JAC-02-CN','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Nevada Jacket Ladies','nevada-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cp','Meet the Nevada Jacket Ladies by Barron—your winter warrior with a sleek funnel collar, zip-off hood, and stylish two-tone soft shell! Stay cozy, chic, and ready for anything with adjustable sleeves, smart pockets, and a flattering curved hem. Winter just got way cooler!','Barron','JAC-02-CP','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Fever Golfer Ladies','fever-golfer-ladies-glf-01-xt','Swing in style with the Fever Golfer Ladies by Barron! Featuring a bold sublimated front print, moisture-wicking polyester, and comfy side slits, this all-year golf shirt keeps you cool, confident, and ready to ace every hole. Elevate your game with flair and comfort—tee off like a pro!','Barron','GLF-01-XT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Dakota Jacket Mens','dakota-jacket-mens-jac-02-cu','Meet the Dakota Jacket Mens by Barron—a winter warrior with quilted micro sleeves, reflective details, and cozy fleece warmth! Stay sleek, durable, and ready for anything with its storm flap and handy pockets. Bold style meets unbeatable comfort—your new go-to winter essential!','Barron','JAC-02-CU','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Dakota Jacket Ladies','dakota-jacket-ladies-jac-02-cv','Meet the Dakota Jacket Ladies by Barron – your winter warrior with a cozy fleece body, sleek micro quilted sleeves, and reflective details for style and safety. Funnel collar, durable pockets, and a chic curved hem make chilly days a breeze. Stay warm, look bold, and conquer winter in style!','Barron','JAC-02-CV','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Omega Golfer Ladies','omega-golfer-ladies-glf-01-yb','Step up your game with the Omega Golfer Ladies by Barron! This two-tone, moisture-wicking polyester polo features a sleek rib knit collar, raglan sleeves, and bold color-blocked panels—delivering unbeatable comfort and style on and off the course. Play bold, look sharp, and stay fresh all day!','Barron','GLF-01-YB','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Enviro Sweater','enviro-sweater-swe-02-pt','Meet the Enviro Sweater by Barron—your cozy, eco-friendly winter must-have! Crafted from recycled cotton-rich fleece, it’s soft, warm, and uniquely shaded. With fitted sleeves, ribbed crew neck, and brushed inner comfort, this sweater wraps you in style and sustainability. Stay bold, stay green!','Barron','SWE-02-PT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Claremont Blouse Ladies','claremont-blouse-ladies-shi-02-nh','Turn heads in the Claremont Blouse by Barron! With its flattering cut-away neckline, chic printed diamond pattern, and soft poly-cotton blend, this all-year casual essential offers style and comfort that fits like a dream. Elevate your everyday look with bold, effortless flair!','Barron','SHI-02-NH','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('UV Tech Golfer Ladies','uv-tech-golfer-ladies-glf-01-ym','Step up your game with the Barron UV Tech Golfer Ladies shirt! Featuring UPF30 UV protection, moisture-wicking polyester, and anti-odor tech, it keeps you cool, fresh, and shielded all day. Stylish self-fabric collar and sleek stitching make it your perfect all-year uniform winner!','Barron','GLF-01-YM','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Easy Care Lounge Shirt Short Sleeve Mens','easy-care-lounge-shirt-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-np','Meet the Barron Easy Care Lounge Shirt: wrinkle-resistant, breathable poly-cotton perfection with a sharp two-piece collar and chest pocket. Stay cool, look sharp, and breeze through your workday—effortless style that’s ready for any business occasion, all year round!','Barron','SHI-02-NP','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Easy Care Blouse Long Sleeve Ladies','easy-care-blouse-long-sleeve-ladies-shi-02-nq','Meet the Barron Easy Care Blouse—your new office hero! Wrinkle-resistant, flattering waist darts, and comfy poly-cotton blend keep you sharp and stylish all day. With a chic two-piece collar and smart side slits, this blouse means business—effortlessly! Perfect for year-round confidence and ease.','Barron','SHI-02-NQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Florida Lounge Shirt Short Sleeve Mens','florida-lounge-shirt-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-nt','Meet the Florida Lounge Shirt by Barron—your new go-to for all-year comfort and style! With stretch fabric, a raised collar, and a sleek patch pocket, it moves with you from boardroom to after-hours. Crafted from a cotton-poly blend, it’s boldly South African and built to impress!','Barron','SHI-02-NT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Barron Tapered Pants Mens','barron-tapered-pants-mens-bot-01-od','Step up your style game with Barron Tapered Pants! Crafted from durable, easy-care polyester with a sleek tapered leg and tailored fit, these pants offer all-day comfort and a sharp, contemporary look. Perfect for any uniform, they combine function and flair effortlessly!','Barron','BOT-01-OD','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Prime Cotton Lounge Long Sleeve Mens','prime-cotton-lounge-long-sleeve-mens-shi-13-bn','Meet the Barron Prime Cotton Lounge Long Sleeve—your all-year, breathable business buddy! Crafted from lightweight 100% cotton with a sharp button-down collar and adjustable cuffs, it’s comfort and style wrapped in one. Elevate your office look while staying cool and confident all day long!','Barron','SHI-13-BN','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Easton Chino Short Mens','easton-chino-short-mens-bot-14-io','Step up your style game with Barron''s Easton Chino Shorts! Crafted from durable 80/20 poly cotton twill with a luxe enzyme wash, these all-year essentials boast comfy slant pockets and a sharp waistband—perfect for hospitality pros who demand both flair and function.','Barron','BOT-14-IO','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Alabama Lounge Short Sleeve Mens','alabama-lounge-short-sleeve-mens-shi-16-ew','Step up your casual game with the Alabama Lounge Short Sleeve Mens shirt by Barron! Crafted from breathable cotton-rich fabric with stylish check patterns, contrast oxford trims, and a sleek shaped hemline, it’s comfort and coolness rolled into one year-round essential. Perfect for effortless style!','Barron','SHI-16-EW','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('BRT Signature Long Sleeve Top Mens','brt-signature-long-sleeve-top-mens-spo-10-zj','Unleash your sporty edge with the BRT Signature Long Sleeve Top! Slim fit, breathable raglan sleeves, and bold contrast stitching keep you comfy and stylish on or off the field. Perfect for winter workouts or layering up—this is performance wear that means business!','BRT Range','SPO-10-ZJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('Alabama Blouse Ladies','alabama-blouse-ladies-shi-16-ex','Meet the Alabama Blouse Ladies by Barron—your new go-to for casual chic! Crafted from soft, cotton-rich fabric with stylish check patterns, contrast trims, and a flattering shaped hemline. Three-quarter sleeves with fold-up flair keep you comfy and cool all year round. Bold style, ultimate comfort!','Barron','SHI-16-EX','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Executive Mercerised Golfer Mens','executive-mercerised-golfer-mens-glf-16-nn','Step up your game with Barron''s Executive Mercerised Golfer—crafted from luxe, cool-touch 100% mercerised cotton for all-year comfort, featuring a sharp self-fabric collar and sleek metal buttons. Feel premium, look executive, and ace every occasion in style!','Barron','GLF-16-NN','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Promo Dress Ladies','promo-dress-ladies-cor-16-nq','Turn heads at every promo event with Barron''s Promo Dress Ladies! Crafted from moisture-wicking polyester, its scoop neckline and sleeveless, feminine fit keep you cool, comfy, and confident all day long. Local, stylish, and perfect for making your brand shine—wear it, own it!','Barron','COR-16-NQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Biodegradable Cotton Golfer','biodegradable-cotton-golfer-glf-16-vj','Meet the Barron Biodegradable Cotton Golfer: stylish, breathable, and eco-friendly! Crafted from 100% biodegradable cotton with a comfy knit rib collar and sleek 3-button placket, it’s your all-year, guilt-free go-to for effortless style and planet-loving comfort. Tee off in green fashion!','Barron','GLF-16-VJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('260g Heavyweight Cotton Golfer','260g-heavyweight-cotton-golfer-glf-16-yc','Step up your game with Barron''s 260g Heavyweight Cotton Golfer! Crafted from 100% heavyweight cotton with a classic two-ridge collar and reinforced stitching, it delivers unbeatable comfort, durability, and style—perfect for executives who demand quality all year round. Bold, sturdy, and effortlessly sharp!','Barron','GLF-16-YC','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Loose Fitting Blouse Ladies','loose-fitting-blouse-ladies-shi-16-yx','Step into comfort and style with Barron''s Loose Fitting Blouse! Crafted from soft, stretchy poly spandex, it boasts a chic button placket, bust darts for shape, and double mitred cuffs. Perfectly loose for all-day office ease—boss your look with effortless elegance!','Barron','SHI-16-YX','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Biodegradable Cotton Lounge Long Sleeve Mens','biodegradable-cotton-lounge-long-sleeve-mens-shi-18-py','Meet the Barron Biodegradable Cotton Lounge Long Sleeve—crafted from 100% breathable, biodegradable cotton with a chic linen look! Its raised collar and double-layer yoke deliver bold style and year-round comfort, making eco-friendly fashion effortlessly cool. Lounge smarter, live greener!','Barron','SHI-18-PY','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Easton Chino Short Ladies','easton-chino-short-ladies-bot-18-wu','Step out in style with the Easton Chino Short Ladies by Barron! Featuring a feminine fit, durable 80/20 poly-cotton twill, and comfy enzyme wash, these shorts deliver all-day comfort and chic flair. Front slanted pockets and smart stitching make them perfect for work or play—bold, breathable, and built to last!','Barron','BOT-18-WU','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Slim Fit Lounge Long Sleeve Mens','slim-fit-lounge-long-sleeve-mens-shi-18-xe','Meet the Barron Slim Fit Lounge Long Sleeve—where sleek style meets unbeatable comfort! Crafted from stretchy poly-cotton-spandex, its slimline raised collar and dropped shoulders deliver a sharp, modern look that moves with you all day. Perfect for business or office vibes, it’s your new year-round power player!','Barron','SHI-18-XE','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Slim Fit Flat Front Pants Mens','slim-fit-flat-front-pants-mens-bot-19-gl','Step up your style game with Barron''s Slim Fit Flat Front Pants! Crafted from soft, durable poly-viscose, these tapered trousers boast sleek flat fronts, reinforced pockets, and a tailored waistband for unbeatable comfort and a sharp, modern look—perfect for formal occasions all year round!','Barron','BOT-19-GL','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Heritage Heavy Duty Trousers Mens','heritage-heavy-duty-trousers-mens-bot-19-fk','Gear up with Barron''s Heritage Heavy Duty Trousers—built tough with stretch for ultimate comfort and freedom! Perfect for all-year outdoor adventures, these cargo bottoms blend rugged durability with flexible fit, making every move effortless. Ready to conquer your day? These trousers have got your back!','Heritage','BOT-19-FK','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Heritage Cargo Trousers Ladies','heritage-cargo-trousers-ladies-bot-19-fh','Step out in style and comfort with Barron''s Heritage Cargo Trousers for ladies! Featuring stretchy fabric for ultimate freedom and multiple pockets for all your essentials, these all-year outdoor-ready bottoms blend functionality with bold fashion. Ready to conquer your day, rain or shine!','Heritage','BOT-19-FH','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Heritage Cargo Trousers Mens','heritage-cargo-trousers-mens-bot-19-fi','Step up your outdoor game with Barron''s Heritage Cargo Trousers! Featuring stretchy fabric for ultimate comfort and freedom, these all-year cargo bottoms blend rugged style with practical pockets. Ready for any adventure, they’re your go-to for bold, versatile menswear that moves with you!','Heritage','BOT-19-FI','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Heritage Multi Pocket Shorts Mens','heritage-multi-pocket-shorts-mens-bot-19-fm','Gear up with Barron''s Heritage Multi Pocket Shorts—your ultimate outdoor companion! Featuring stretchy fabric for all-day comfort and multiple pockets to stash your essentials, these shorts blend style and practicality effortlessly. Ready for any adventure, any season—because you deserve gear that works as hard as you do!','Heritage','BOT-19-FM','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel'),('Heritage Double Pocket Shacket','heritage-double-pocket-shacket-jac-19-fj','Meet the Heritage Double Pocket Shacket by Barron—your all-year, lightweight outdoor hero! With stretch for ultimate comfort and double pockets for serious style and storage, this unisex jacket keeps you moving freely while looking sharp. Ready for adventure? Grab yours and own the outdoors!','Heritage','JAC-19-FJ','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel')) AS v(name,handle,description,brand,item,features,category_slug) JOIN public.shop_categories c ON c.slug=v.category_slug ON CONFLICT (handle) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,description=EXCLUDED.description,brand=EXCLUDED.brand,supplier_item_number=EXCLUDED.supplier_item_number,product_features=EXCLUDED.product_features,category_id=EXCLUDED.category_id,status=EXCLUDED.status;
INSERT INTO public.shop_products (title,handle,description,brand,supplier_item_number,product_features,category_id,base_price,currency_code,collection,status,position) SELECT v.name,v.handle,v.description,v.brand,v.item,v.features,c.id,0,'ZAR','corporate','published',0 FROM (VALUES ('Heritage Washed T-Shirt','heritage-washed-t-shirt-tst-19-ft','Step into timeless cool with Barron''s Heritage Washed T-Shirt! Pigment-dyed for that effortlessly vintage vibe, this unisex round neck tee is your all-year, outdoor adventure essential. Comfortable, stylish, and uniquely you—wear heritage, wear bold!','Heritage','TST-19-FT','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Heritage Slim Fit Cargo Trousers Mens','heritage-slim-fit-cargo-trousers-mens-bot-19-lz','Step up your style game with Barron''s Heritage Slim Fit Cargo Trousers! Sleek, versatile, and designed for all-year wear, these cargos blend comfort and edge perfectly. Slim fit means sharp looks, while cargo pockets add that rugged, practical vibe—your new go-to for bold, effortless cool!','Heritage','BOT-19-LZ','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Heritage Slim Fit Cargo Trousers Ladies','heritage-slim-fit-cargo-trousers-ladies-bot-19-ma','Step up your style game with Barron''s Heritage Slim Fit Cargo Trousers for ladies! Sleek, comfy, and ready for any season, these cargos blend fashion and function perfectly—pockets for days and a fit that flatters. Your new go-to for effortless cool all year round!','Heritage','BOT-19-MA','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Heritage Ventilated Quick Dry Golfer Mens','heritage-ventilated-quick-dry-golfer-mens-glf-19-op','nan','Barron','GLF-19-OP','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Light Weight Reversible Jacket Mens','light-weight-reversible-jacket-mens-jac-19-oz','nan','Barron','JAC-19-OZ','Minimum order quantity: 3','apparel'),('Denim Shirt Short Sleeve Mens','denim-shirt-short-sleeve-mens-shi-02-ib','Rock your casual look all year round with Barron''s Denim Shirt! Crafted from 100% cotton denim, it’s comfy, breathable, and built to last. Featuring a sharp button-down collar, double-layered yoke, and handy front pockets, it’s style and function rolled into one bold statement!','Barron','SHI-02-IB','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Shoulder Stripe Golfer','shoulder-stripe-golfer-glf-01-qo','Step up your game with the Barron Shoulder Stripe Golfer! Featuring a ridged striped collar, sporty contrast piping, and a comfy cotton-rich fabric, this sharp, durable shirt keeps you cool and stylish all year. Perfect for uniforms or the fairway—confidence never looked this good!','Barron','GLF-01-QO','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Fusion Golfer Ladies','fusion-golfer-ladies-glf-01-tn','Step up your game with the Fusion Golfer Ladies by Barron! This stylish, all-year poly-cotton piqué knit shirt boasts sleek Oxford fabric details and a chic stepped hem—perfect for looking sharp on and off the course. Comfort meets class in every swing!','Barron','GLF-01-TN','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Stretch Pique Knit Golfer Ladies','stretch-pique-knit-golfer-ladies-glf-13-bg','Step up your game with Barron''s Stretch Pique Knit Golfer Ladies! Crafted from comfy cotton-spandex blend with a stretch fit, ribbed collar, and sleek marble buttons, it’s your all-year uniform upgrade—flexible, stylish, and ready to swing with you in ultimate comfort.','Barron','GLF-13-BG','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Osaka Cargo Pants Mens','osaka-cargo-pants-mens-bot-13-bc','Gear up with Barron''s Osaka Cargo Pants—crafted from tough 100% Nylon Ripstop for all-year outdoor adventures! With smart pockets, secure closures, and rugged double-stitched seams, these cargos blend utility and style, keeping your essentials safe while you conquer the day. Ready for anything, anywhere!','Barron','BOT-13-BC','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Lennox Golfer Mens','lennox-golfer-mens-glf-14-ih','Step up your game with the Lennox Golfer Mens by Barron! Stylish, comfy, and crafted from breathable 65/35 poly cotton, it features a sleek Johnny collar and side slits for ultimate mobility. Perfect for casual swings or all-year wear—elevate your look and performance effortlessly!','Barron','GLF-14-IH','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Knitted Pique Lounge Long Sleeve Mens','knitted-pique-lounge-long-sleeve-mens-shi-16-yv','Elevate your office style with Barron''s Knitted Pique Lounge Long Sleeve! Crafted from breathable 50/50 poly cotton, it boasts a sharp raised collar, sleek button placket, and comfy dropped-shoulder yoke—perfect for all-year business coolness with a twist of surface flair!','Barron','SHI-16-YV','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Quake Golfer Ladies','quake-golfer-ladies-glf-18-ks','Tee off in style with the Quake Golfer Ladies by Barron! Crafted from lightweight 150g polyester, its flattering V-neck and vibrant sublimated design keep you cool, comfy, and confident on the green—all year round. Game on, gorgeous!','Barron','GLF-18-KS','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Rapture Golfer Ladies','rapture-golfer-ladies-glf-18-xi','Step up your game with the Rapture Golfer Ladies by Barron! Ultra-soft, stretchy nylon-spandex fabric hugs you in comfort, while bold contrast details add flair. Perfect for all-year executive style—look sharp, feel unstoppable on and off the course!','Barron','GLF-18-XI','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('3D Crease Stretch Jeans Mens','3d-crease-stretch-jeans-mens-bot-19-pc','nan','Barron','BOT-19-PC','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('3D Crease Stretch Jeans Ladies','3d-crease-stretch-jeans-ladies-bot-19-pd','nan','Barron','BOT-19-PD','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Heritage Ventilated Quick Dry Golfer Ladies','heritage-ventilated-quick-dry-golfer-ladies-glf-19-oq','nan','Barron','GLF-19-OQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','apparel'),('Reversible Padded Puffer Mens','reversible-padded-puffer-mens-jac-16-px','Meet the Barron Reversible Padded Puffer—your ultimate winter wingman! Rock two bold looks in one with its two-tone color block and sleek plain sides. Fully padded, quilted, and nylon-crafted, it keeps you cozy while elastic cuffs and zip pockets amp up the style and function. Flip it, zip it, own winter!','Barron','JAC-16-PX','Minimum order quantity: 2','apparel'),('Voyager Trek Medium Trolley Duffel','voyager-trek-medium-trolley-duffel-bag-18-ih','Meet the Voyager Trek Medium Trolley Duffel—your ultimate travel sidekick! With smooth rollerblade wheels and a spacious 49L capacity, it glides effortlessly while holding all your essentials. Stylish, sturdy, and unisex, it’s perfect for every adventure, all year round. Travel smart, travel bold!','Voyager','BAG-18-IH','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Volkano Orthopaedic Series 27 L Backpack','volkano-orthopaedic-series-27-l-backpack-bag-18-ex','Meet the Volkano Orthopaedic Series 27L Backpack—your ultimate business buddy! With a comfy padded back, breathable straps, and a snug 15.6 laptop compartment, it keeps you organized and pain-free all day. Bold, spacious, and built for every season—work just got way cooler!','Volkano','BAG-18-EX','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Voyager Backpack','voyager-backpack-bag-02-zp','Meet the Voyager Backpack, your sleek and sturdy companion for business and office life. Crafted from durable 600D nylon with a rubberized carry handle, it features multiple zippered compartments and adjustable straps for ultimate comfort and organization, making every journey stylish and effortless.','Indestruktible','BAG-02-ZP','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('i-Backpack','i-backpack-bag-02-zs','Meet the i-Backpack, your ultimate all-year companion crafted from extra-strong 1680D nylon, boasting spacious compartments, zippered pockets, and padded straps for comfort. Stylishly durable and organized, it’s designed to keep your essentials secure and accessible—perfect for work, travel, or everyday adventures!','Indestruktible','BAG-02-ZS','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Tourista Backpack','tourista-backpack-bag-02-zt','Meet the Tourista Backpack, your ultimate travel companion crafted from extra-strength 1680D nylon for durability and style. With spacious zippered compartments, padded adjustable straps, and handy mesh side pockets, it’s perfect for holiday adventures all year round—bold, reliable, and ready to explore!','Indestruktible','BAG-02-ZT','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Medium Sports Bag','medium-sports-bag-bag-03-ni','Meet the Indestruktible Medium Sports Bag—your ultimate all-year companion! Crafted from tough 600D nylon, it’s spacious (60x31x32cm) with smart zippered compartments and an adjustable shoulder strap, making your gear easy to carry and access. Durable, stylish, and ready for any adventure—grab yours and conquer the day!','Barron','BAG-03-NI','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Large Sports Bag','large-sports-bag-bag-03-nj','Meet the Indestruktible Large Sports Bag—your ultimate game-day sidekick! Crafted from tough 600D nylon, it’s spacious (70x33x35cm) with zippered compartments and an adjustable strap, making gear-hauling a breeze. Durable, stylish, and ready for action—carry your sport like a champ!','Indestruktible','BAG-03-NJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Lazio Laptop Trolley Bag','lazio-laptop-trolley-bag-bag-03-ey','Meet the Lazio Laptop Trolley Bag by Indestruktible—your sleek, sturdy travel buddy! With smooth trolley wheels, a padded laptop pocket, and cabin-size design, it glides through airports and boardrooms alike. Stylish nylon, extendable handle, and smart compartments keep you organized and unstoppable!','Indestruktible','BAG-03-EY','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Hard Shell Cabin Bag','hard-shell-cabin-bag-bag-03-ff','Meet the Barron Hard Shell Cabin Bag: tough ABS shell, smooth 360° wheels, and a secure combination lock. With an extendable handle and smart compartments, travel hassle-free and in style. Compact, durable, and ready for all-year adventures—your ultimate travel sidekick!','Barron','BAG-03-FF','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Dual Front Pocket Rolling Travel Duffel','dual-front-pocket-rolling-travel-duffel-bag-03-fh','Meet the Barron Dual Front Pocket Rolling Travel Duffel—your ultimate travel sidekick! With rugged 600D Ripstop fabric, smooth trolley wheels, and dual front pockets, it’s built for adventure and easy organization. Glide through airports in style and pack like a pro—travel just got a whole lot cooler!','Barron','BAG-03-FH','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Trailwalker Backpack With Raincover','trailwalker-backpack-with-raincover-bag-15-7s','Meet the Trailwalker Backpack by Indestruktible—your ultimate outdoor sidekick! With a padded laptop compartment and tough 600D polyester, it guards your gear rain or shine. Compact yet spacious (31x41x16cm) and ready for any adventure with a built-in raincover. Bold protection, all year round!','Indestruktible','BAG-15-7S','Minimum order quantity: 3','bags'),('Kingsons Prime Series Laptop Backpack','kingsons-prime-series-laptop-backpack-bag-18-aa','Meet the Kingsons Prime Series Laptop Backpack – your ultimate business sidekick! With a water-resistant build, a cozy 15.6 laptop nook, secret anti-theft stash, and sleek zippered compartments, it’s designed to keep your gear safe, organized, and ready to conquer the office jungle—all year round!','Kingsons','BAG-18-AA','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Kingsons Vision Series 15.6 Inch Laptop Backpack','kingsons-vision-series-15-6-inch-laptop-backpack-bag-18-ac','Meet the Kingsons Vision Series Backpack: your 15.6 laptop’s new best friend! Splashproof, comfy padded straps, and smart compartments keep you organized and dry. Plus, the luggage trolley strap makes travel a breeze. Bold, practical, and ready for business—carry your tech in style everywhere!','Kingsons','BAG-18-AC','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Backpack Storil','backpack-storil-bag-19-ku','Meet the Backpack Storil by Barron – your all-year, all-sport sidekick! Rock the built-in shoe compartment and eco-friendly RPET fabric for ultimate convenience and sustainability. Bold, practical, and ready to elevate your game—this backpack’s got your back, literally!','Barron','BAG-19-KU','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Trailwalker 2 Backpack','trailwalker-2-backpack-bag-02-zx','Meet the Trailwalker 2 Backpack—a sleek, durable companion crafted from tough 600D nylon with a rubberized base to withstand any adventure. Featuring padded straps, multiple zippered pockets, and handy mesh sides, it’s designed for outdoor enthusiasts who crave style, comfort, and practicality all year round.','Indestruktible','BAG-02-ZX','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Supreme Double Decker Golf Bag','supreme-double-decker-golf-bag-bag-03-nl','Meet the Supreme Double Decker Golf Bag by Indestruktible—built tough with extra-strength 1680D nylon and packed with zippered compartments for all your gear! Carry it your way with adjustable straps and handles. Sport-ready, multi-purpose, and designed to elevate your game all year long!','Indestruktible','BAG-03-NL','Minimum order quantity: 3','bags'),('Pesaro Laptop Trolley Backpack','pesaro-laptop-trolley-backpack-bag-03-ew','Meet the Pesaro Laptop Trolley Backpack by Indestruktible—your ultimate travel buddy! With rugged nylon, smooth trolley wheels, and padded straps, it’s built for comfort and durability. Fits most 15” laptops, cabin-sized, and packed with smart pockets. Roll, carry, conquer your day in style!','Indestruktible','BAG-03-EW','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Out of Africa Novahide Bush Bag','out-of-africa-novahide-bush-bag-bag-03-pv','Meet the Out of Africa Novahide Bush Bag by Barron—your ultimate travel sidekick! Crafted from durable Angola PVC, it boasts a roomy zippered main compartment, sleek contrast accents, and versatile carry handles plus an adjustable shoulder strap. Bold, tough, and ready for any adventure!','Barron','BAG-03-PV','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Large Executive Sports Bag','large-executive-sports-bag-bag-03-ob','Meet the Barron Large Executive Sports Bag—your ultimate all-year companion! With spacious compartments, durable polyester build, and adjustable straps, it’s designed to carry your gear in style and comfort. Sporty, sleek, and ready for any adventure—upgrade your game with Barron!','Barron','BAG-03-OB','Minimum order quantity: 3','bags'),('Sports Bag with Shoe Compartment','sports-bag-with-shoe-compartment-bag-03-oe','Meet the Barron Sports Bag with Shoe Compartment—your ultimate game-day sidekick! Crafted from tough 600D polyester, it keeps your gear organized with multiple zippered pockets and a separate shoe compartment. Adjustable strap and carry handles make hauling a breeze. Ready, set, score in style!','Barron','BAG-03-OE','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Hard Shell Luggage Trolley','hard-shell-luggage-trolley-bag-03-fm','Meet the Barron Hard Shell Luggage Trolley—your ultimate travel sidekick! With a tough ABS shell, smooth 360° wheels, extendable handle, and secure combination lock, it’s built to glide through airports and protect your gear in style. Travel smart, travel bold!','Barron','BAG-03-FM','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Stylish Front Zip Pocket Backpack','stylish-front-zip-pocket-backpack-bag-03-bi','Meet your new everyday hero: the Stylish Front Zip Pocket Backpack, crafted from durable 300D matte polyester with multiple zippered compartments and padded straps for ultimate comfort. Its sleek design and practical pockets keep you organized and ready for any adventure, all year round!','Barron','BAG-03-BI','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Curved Piping Backpack','curved-piping-backpack-bag-03-bj','Step up your style game with the Curved Piping Backpack, featuring a sleek two-tone design and eye-catching reflective piping. Crafted from durable 420D polyester, it offers padded comfort, multiple zippered compartments, and a laptop sleeve that fits most 15-inch laptops—perfect for work or play all year round!','Barron','BAG-03-BJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Melange Crossover Laptop Backpack','melange-crossover-laptop-backpack-bag-03-iw','Meet the Melange Crossover Laptop Backpack by Indie — your sleek, all-year business buddy! With padded handles, adjustable straps, and a secure 15 laptop holder, it’s built for comfort and style. Stay organized with multiple zippered pockets and conquer your day hands-free and bold!','Indie','BAG-03-IW','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('2 Person Picnic Backpack','2-person-picnic-backpack-bag-14-bw','Meet the Barron 2 Person Picnic Backpack – your ultimate outdoor sidekick! Stylish, spacious, and insulated to keep your snacks fresh for 5-6 hours. Comes loaded with cutlery, plates, and glasses for two. Picnic perfection, hands-free and hassle-free!','Barron','BAG-14-BW','Minimum order quantity: 3','bags'),('Classic Trolley Bag','classic-trolley-bag-bag-14-ci','Meet the Barron Classic Trolley Bag: lightweight polyester, smooth trolley wheels, and zippered compartments make travel a breeze! Compact yet roomy (50x35x35cm), it carries up to 12kg with style and ease. Roll, zip, and go—your ultimate travel sidekick all year round!','Barron','BAG-14-CI','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Duffle Roller Bag','duffle-roller-bag-bag-14-gw','Meet the Barron Duffle Roller Bag – your travel game-changer! Crafted from tough 900D polyester, it boasts roomy compartments, smooth trolley wheels, and an extendable handle for effortless gliding. Bold, durable, and spacious – pack smart and roll in style wherever you go!','Barron','BAG-14-GW','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Anti-Theft Backpack Danium','anti-theft-backpack-danium-bag-15-7t','Meet the Anti-Theft Backpack Danium by Indestruktible—your fearless companion with padded straps, a secret back pocket, and security zippers. Stylish, tough 300D polyester shields your laptop and valuables all year round. Stay secure, hands-free, and ready for anything!','Indestruktible','BAG-15-7T','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Rigal Laptop Backpack','rigal-laptop-backpack-bag-15-7v','Meet the Rigal Laptop Backpack by Indestruktible—your ultimate business buddy! Crafted from tough 290 polyester twill, it’s built to protect your laptop with padded straps and handle. Sleek, spacious (45x30x13cm), and comfy for all-year hustle. Ready to conquer your office grind in style!','Indestruktible','BAG-15-7V','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Cruz Laptop Backpack','cruz-laptop-backpack-bag-15-7w','Meet the Cruz Laptop Backpack by Indestruktible—your all-year, all-business hero! Crafted from tough 600D polyester with padded straps and handle, it’s built for comfort and durability. Stylish, spacious (47x31x17.5cm), and ready to protect your laptop wherever work takes you!','Indestruktible','BAG-15-7W','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Cellini Infinity Laptop Cover With Scanstop','cellini-infinity-laptop-cover-with-scanstop-bag-16-tc','Meet the Cellini Infinity Laptop Cover With Scanstop – your sleek, leather fortress for a 15 laptop! With organized pockets for your phone, cards, and pens, plus RFID protection, it’s style, security, and savvy all in one. Ready to conquer every conference, all year round!','Barron','BAG-16-TC','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Infinity Multi-Pocket Backpack With Scanstop','cellini-infinity-multi-pocket-backpack-with-scanstop-bag-16-tf','Meet the Cellini Infinity Multi-Pocket Backpack with Scanstop—your sleek, leather powerhouse! With smart organization, RFID protection, and a soft shell, it’s perfect for business pros on the go. Stylish, secure, and built to last with a 5-year warranty—upgrade your carry game today!','Cellini','BAG-16-TF','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Pro X Trolley Carry On','cellini-pro-x-trolley-carry-on-bag-17-xx','Meet the Cellini Pro X Trolley Carry On—your travel game-changer! Tough Protek PU and polycarbonate shell, ultra-smooth Fastline™ wheels, TSA locks, and a self-repairing zip keep your gear safe and stylish. Expandable space and featherlight 3.7kg design mean more adventure, less hassle!','Barron','BAG-17-XX','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Volkano Rhodes Series 70L Duffle Bag','volkano-rhodes-series-70l-duffle-bag-bag-18-fl','Meet the Volkano Rhodes Series 70L Duffle Bag – your ultimate travel sidekick! With 3 roomy compartments and a sleek 67 cm design, it’s perfect for all-year adventures. Bold, spacious, and unisex, it’s ready to carry your world with style and ease!','Barron','BAG-18-FL','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Volkano Stealth Series Business, Travel and Laptop Backpack','volkano-stealth-series-business-travel-and-laptop-backpack-bag-18-gc','Meet the Volkano Stealth Series Backpack—your sleek, all-year sidekick! With a padded 15.6 laptop compartment, comfy adjustable straps, and smart storage galore, it’s perfect for business or travel. Stay organized, stylish, and ready to conquer your day—boldly and effortlessly!','Volkano','BAG-18-GC','Minimum order quantity: 3','bags'),('Volkano Tough Series Backpack','volkano-tough-series-backpack-bag-18-gk','Meet the Volkano Tough Series Backpack—your all-year, business-ready sidekick! With a snug 15.6 laptop compartment, rubberized handle for a firm grip, and a headphone slot for tunes on the go, this unisex backpack blends toughness with smart style. Gear up and own your day!','Volkano','BAG-18-GK','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Heritage Grant Backpack','heritage-grant-backpack-bag-19-kp','Meet the Heritage Grant Backpack by Barron—your all-year, executive-ready sidekick! Sleek, sturdy, and laptop-friendly, it blends style with serious function. Carry your essentials with confidence and flair—because your gear deserves a first-class ride!','Heritage','BAG-19-KP','Minimum order quantity: 3','bags'),('Heritage Sharyl Bag','heritage-sharyl-bag-bag-19-kq','Meet the Heritage Sharyl Bag by Barron—your all-year, go-anywhere travel buddy! Stylish, sturdy, and ready to roll, it keeps your essentials organized and your adventures hassle-free. Elevate your travel game with a bag that’s as bold and reliable as you are!','Heritage','BAG-19-KQ','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Kleintor Business Trolley','kleintor-business-trolley-bag-03-fv','Meet the Kleintor Business Trolley by Barron – your sleek, silver-shell sidekick with 4 smooth wheels, TSA lock, and a cozy padded pocket for laptops up to 17. Glide through your day with style, security, and space designed for the ultimate business hustle!','Barron','BAG-03-FV','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Stash Backpack','stash-backpack-bag-14-cg','Meet the Stash Backpack by Barron—your sleek, foldable sidekick with roomy zippered compartments and comfy adjustable straps. Crafted from durable polyester, it’s built to stash your gear all year round with style and ease. Ready, set, stash and go!','Barron','BAG-14-CG','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Adey Duffel Bag','adey-duffel-bag-bag-14-ch','Meet the Adey Duffel Bag by Barron—your all-year, go-anywhere sidekick! With roomy zippered compartments, tough polyester build, and comfy adjustable straps, it’s perfect for sports or adventure. Bold, durable, and ready to roll—grab yours and carry confidence wherever you go!','Barron','BAG-14-CH','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Cellini Origin Medium Trolley Duffle','cellini-origin-medium-trolley-duffle-bag-16-rp','Meet the Cellini Origin Medium Trolley Duffle: your sleek, 67L travel sidekick with durable soft shell fabric and smooth 2-wheel glide. Spacious, stylish, and ready for any adventure—travel smarter, lighter, and bolder all year round!','Cellini','BAG-16-RP','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Microlite Business Organiser Carry On','cellini-microlite-business-organiser-carry-on-bag-16-sa','Meet the Cellini Microlite Business Organiser Carry On—your sleek, hard-shell sidekick with a 37L capacity, TSA lock, and smart compartments for laptop, phone, and pens. Travel smart, stay organized, and turn heads with bold style and unbeatable 10-year durability!','Barron','BAG-16-SA','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Infinity Large Business Case With Scanstop','cellini-infinity-large-business-case-with-scanstop-bag-16-ta','Meet the Cellini Infinity Large Business Case—crafted from luxe leather with Scanstop tech to keep your data safe. Spacious, organized, and backed by a 5-year warranty, it’s your sleek, secure sidekick for every meeting and beyond. Elevate your hustle with style and peace of mind!','Barron','BAG-16-TA','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Infinity Document Case With Scanstop','cellini-infinity-document-case-with-scanstop-bag-16-tb','Meet the Cellini Infinity Document Case with Scanstop – your sleek, leather fortress for laptops up to 15 and tablets up to 11. Soft shell comfort meets ultimate security with Scanstop technology. Stylish, durable, and backed by a 5-year warranty, it’s the bold choice for confident professionals on the go!','Barron','BAG-16-TB','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Infinity Garment Bag With Scanstop','cellini-infinity-garment-bag-with-scanstop-bag-16-te','Meet the Cellini Infinity Garment Bag with Scanstop—your stylish armor for wrinkle-free travel! Crafted from luxe leather, it’s sleek, durable, and built to last with a 5-year warranty. Say goodbye to garment chaos and hello to effortless elegance wherever you go!','Barron','BAG-16-TE','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Infinity Crossbody Sling With Scanstop','cellini-infinity-crossbody-sling-with-scanstop-bag-16-ti','Meet the Cellini Infinity Crossbody Sling—your stylish, all-year leather companion with Scanstop tech for ultimate security! Compact yet spacious with an organizer, it keeps essentials safe and accessible. Bold design, 5-year warranty—travel smart, look sharp, and breeze through life hands-free!','Barron','BAG-16-TI','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Optima Reporter Bag','cellini-optima-reporter-bag-bag-17-xu','Meet the Cellini Optima Reporter Bag: your sleek, unisex sidekick for seamless organization! Compact yet spacious, it effortlessly stores your tablet, phone, cables, and cards—making every conference or commute a breeze. Bold style meets smart functionality—carry confidence everywhere you go!','Barron','BAG-17-XU','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Cellini Tri Pak Medium Trolley Case','cellini-tri-pak-medium-trolley-case-bag-17-yg','Meet the Cellini Tri Pak Medium Trolley Case: your travel game-changer! Glide effortlessly on 4 silent Hinomoto wheels, enjoy double-sided packing with included cubes, and breeze through security with an integrated TSA lock. Stylish, spacious (68L), and super organized—travel smarter, not harder!','Barron','BAG-17-YG','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Xpedition Carry On Trolley Trunk Case','cellini-xpedition-carry-on-trolley-trunk-case-bag-17-yh','Meet the Cellini Xpedition Carry On: your ultimate travel sidekick! Glide effortlessly on 4 double-wheels, pack smart with the Inside Story system, and stay secure with a TSA lock. Lightweight, spacious, and ready for any adventure—travel bold, travel Cellini!','Barron','BAG-17-YH','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Xpedition Large Trolley Trunk Case','cellini-xpedition-large-trolley-trunk-case-bag-17-yi','Meet the Cellini Xpedition Large Trolley Trunk Case: your ultimate travel sidekick! With smooth 4 double-wheels, easy-grip handles, TSA lock, and smart packing system—including a wet pouch and Trakpouch—traveling just got effortless, secure, and stylish. Ready to roll with you, anywhere, anytime!','Barron','BAG-17-YI','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Xpedition Medium Trolley Trunk Case','cellini-xpedition-medium-trolley-trunk-case-bag-17-yj','Meet the Cellini Xpedition Medium Trolley Trunk Case—your travel sidekick with 4 smooth double-wheels, easy-grip handles, and a smart packing system featuring a wet pouch and Trakpouch for peace of mind. TSA lock-secured, lightweight, and spacious—travel smarter, not harder!','Barron','BAG-17-YJ','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Travelwize Artic Series 4-Wheel Spinner Trolley Case 55cm','travelwize-artic-series-4-wheel-spinner-trolley-case-55cm-bag-18-dh','Meet the Travelwize Artic Series 55cm Spinner Trolley—your ultimate travel sidekick! Glide effortlessly with 4 multi-directional wheels, stay organized with smart compartments, and breeze through airports with a sturdy telescopic handle. Travel smart, travel bold, travelwize!','Barron','BAG-18-DH','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Travelwize Artic Series 4-Wheel Spinner Trolley Case 65cm','travelwize-artic-series-4-wheel-spinner-trolley-case-65cm-bag-18-di','Meet the Travelwize Artic Series 65cm spinner—your ultimate travel buddy! Glide effortlessly with 4 smooth spinner wheels, stay organized with smart compartments, and roll in style with a sturdy telescopic handle. Travel smarter, lighter, and cooler—wherever your adventure takes you!','Barron','BAG-18-DI','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Tosca Platinum Duffel','tosca-platinum-duffel-bag-20-ne','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-NE','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Cellini Smart 4-Wheel Carry On Trolley','cellini-smart-4-wheel-carry-on-trolley-bag-16-rd','Meet the Cellini Smart 4-Wheel Carry On Trolley—your travel BFF! Glide effortlessly with smooth 4-wheel mobility, stay secure with an integrated TSA lock, and enjoy durable synthetic soft shell protection. Compact, stylish, and backed by a 10-year warranty—travel smart, travel bold!','Cellini','BAG-16-RD','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Origin Weekender Duffle Bag With Scanstop','cellini-origin-weekender-duffle-bag-with-scanstop-bag-16-rq','Meet the Cellini Origin Weekender Duffle with Scanstop—your sleek, 49L soft shell sidekick that’s tough, stylish, and scan-proof! Glide through trips with durable Duratex fabric and smart anti-scan tech, all packed in a compact, bold design. Weekend adventures just got a major upgrade!','Barron','BAG-16-RQ','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Pro X Large 4 Wheel Trolley Case','cellini-pro-x-large-4-wheel-trolley-case-bag-17-xv','Meet the Cellini Pro X Large Trolley – your travel sidekick built tough with Protek PU and polycarbonate armor! Glide on Fastline™ wheels, secure your gear with TSA locks, and expand for extra packing power. Durable, stylish, and ready for any adventure—travel like a pro!','Barron','BAG-17-XV','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Pro X Medium 4 Wheel Trolley Case','cellini-pro-x-medium-4-wheel-trolley-case-bag-17-xw','Meet the Cellini Pro X Medium Trolley: rugged Protek PU meets sleek polycarbonate, rolling on ultra-stable Fastline™ wheels. TSA locks, self-repairing zips, and an expander mean stress-free, spacious travel. Durable, secure, and ready to roll—your ultimate travel sidekick!','Barron','BAG-17-XW','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Smartcase Large 4 Wheel Trolley Case','cellini-smartcase-large-4-wheel-trolley-case-bag-17-xy','Roll in style with the Cellini Smartcase Large 4 Wheel Trolley! Expand for 20% extra space, stay organized with smart inner pockets, and travel worry-free with a TSA lock. Lightweight, comfy handles, and smooth wheels make every trip a breeze—your ultimate travel sidekick!','Barron','BAG-17-XY','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Tri Pak Carry On Trolley Case','cellini-tri-pak-carry-on-trolley-case-bag-17-ye','Meet the Cellini Tri Pak Carry On: your travel game-changer! Front-loading access, double-sided packing, and a TSA lock keep you organized, secure, and stress-free. Lightweight yet spacious (41L), it’s the ultimate bold companion for savvy, stylish jet-setters. Ready, set, pack like a pro!','Barron','BAG-17-YE','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Volkano Woodrow Series 15.6 Inch Laptop Backpack','volkano-woodrow-series-15-6-inch-laptop-backpack-bag-18-he','Meet the Volkano Woodrow Backpack—your 15.6 laptop’s new best friend! With comfy straps, superior padding, and tough stress points, it’s built to conquer your daily grind. Stay organized with multiple pockets and sip easy with dual water bottle holders. Business-ready, all-year-round, and seriously stylish!','Volkano','BAG-18-HE','Minimum order quantity: 2','bags'),('Voyager Cabana Medium 4 Wheel Trolley Case','voyager-cabana-medium-4-wheel-trolley-case-bag-18-hy','Meet the Voyager Cabana Medium Trolley—your spacious, smooth-rolling travel buddy with 4 double-glider wheels, a secure combo lock, and easy-grip handles. Lightweight yet roomy (73L), it turns packing and navigating airports into pure joy. Travel smart, travel bold with Voyager!','Voyager','BAG-18-HY','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Turmon Backpack','turmon-backpack-bag-19-lf','Meet the Turmon Backpack by Barron – your all-year, outdoor adventure buddy! Crafted from sustainable RPET, it’s eco-friendly and tough. With a dedicated laptop bag, it keeps your tech safe and stylish on the go. Ready to conquer every journey? This backpack’s got your back!','Barron','BAG-19-LF','Minimum order quantity: 5','bags'),('Cellini Allure Large 4 Wheel Trolley with TSA Lock','cellini-allure-large-4-wheel-trolley-with-tsa-lock-bag-03-gw','Travel smart and stylish with the Cellini Allure Large 4 Wheel Trolley! Lightweight polyester, smooth 4-wheel glide, and a TSA lock keep your gear safe and effortless. Perfect for holiday adventures—confidence and convenience rolled into one sleek, durable package!','Cellini','BAG-03-GW','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Smartcase Medium 4 Wheel Trolley Case','cellini-smartcase-medium-4-wheel-trolley-case-bag-17-xz','Meet the Cellini Smartcase Medium 4 Wheel Trolley – your travel game-changer! With a 20% expandable packing boost, TSA lock security, and smart inner organization, it’s lightweight yet tough. Glide through airports with padded handles and smooth wheels—travel smart, stylish, and stress-free every trip!','Barron','BAG-17-XZ','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Optima Business Organiser Carry On','cellini-optima-business-organiser-carry-on-bag-16-rs','Meet the Cellini Optima Business Organiser Carry On – your sleek, 4-wheel travel partner with a TSA lock, dedicated phone and pen pockets, and space for laptops up to 15. Soft shell, 35L capacity, and a 10-year warranty make business travel a breeze. Ready, set, jet!','Cellini','BAG-16-RS','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Cellini Tri Pak Large Trolley Case','cellini-tri-pak-large-trolley-case-bag-17-yf','Meet the Cellini Tri Pak Large Trolley Case – your travel game-changer! Glide silently on 4 double Hinomoto wheels, enjoy effortless access with the front loading system, and pack like a pro with double-sided compartments plus 2 large packing cubes. TSA lock secures your journey in style!','Barron','BAG-17-YF','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Tosca Urban 50cm Trolley Case','tosca-urban-50cm-trolley-case-bag-20-nf','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-NF','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Tosca Platinum 75cm Trolley Duffel','tosca-platinum-75cm-trolley-duffel-bag-20-nd','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-ND','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Tosca Platinum 50cm Cabin Case','tosca-platinum-50cm-cabin-case-bag-20-mz','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-MZ','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Conwood Vector 75cm 100% Pc Trolley Case','conwood-vector-75cm-100-pc-trolley-case-bag-20-ma','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-MA','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Tosca Platinum 70cm Trolley Case','tosca-platinum-70cm-trolley-case-bag-20-nc','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-NC','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Conwood Vector 55cm 100% Pc Carry On Trolley Case','conwood-vector-55cm-100-pc-carry-on-trolley-case-bag-20-ly','nan','Elegant','BAG-20-LY','Minimum order quantity: 1','bags'),('Hard Pilot Case','hard-pil