alt & pepper—this set turns every cookout into a flavor fiesta!','Barron','GFT-06-EU','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Two Person Willow Picnic Basket','two-person-willow-picnic-basket-gft-08-ai','Unleash outdoor fun with Barron’s Two Person Willow Picnic Basket! Stylish reed design, stainless steel cutlery, and ceramic plates/mugs make every picnic a breeze. Compact yet complete—perfect for year-round adventures. Grab yours and elevate your alfresco game!','Barron','GFT-08-AI','Minimum order quantity: 2','gifting'),('Slim Aluminium 4000 mAh Powerbank','slim-aluminium-4000-mah-powerbank-gft-08-fy','Power up in style with Barron''s Slim Aluminium 4000 mAh Powerbank! Sleek, curved, and ultra-portable, it charges dual devices fast with a solid aluminum body and handy battery indicator. Perfect for tech lovers on the go—power meets elegance in your pocket!','Barron','GFT-08-FY','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Auto Emergency First Aid Kit','auto-emergency-first-aid-kit-gft-06-dp','Be ready for anything with the Barron Auto Emergency First Aid Kit! Packed with 40 essential items in a durable EVA pouch, it’s your all-in-one lifesaver on the road. Compact, organized, and ISO certified—safety has never looked this cool or been this easy!','Barron','GFT-06-DP','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('6 Can Mini-Fridge With Built In Bluetooth Speaker','6-can-mini-fridge-with-built-in-bluetooth-speaker-gft-08-bd','Chill your drinks and pump your tunes with Barron''s 6 Can Mini-Fridge! This sleek, portable powerhouse cools 20-25° below ambient, plays Bluetooth beats, and fits 6 cans—perfect for outdoor fun anytime, anywhere. Hot, cold, or bold, it’s your ultimate party sidekick!','Barron','GFT-08-BD','Minimum order quantity: 1','gifting'),('500ml Ariston Cup','500ml-ariston-cup-gft-06-ns','Sip in style with the 500ml Ariston Cup by Barron! Crafted from eco-friendly bamboo with a sleek stainless steel interior, it keeps drinks fresh and secure with a smart dosing lid. Perfectly boxed for gifting, this bold, sustainable sipper is your all-year, go-anywhere hydration hero!','Barron','GFT-06-NS','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Cool Bag Botum','cool-bag-botum-gft-14-au','Meet the Cool Bag Botum by Barron – your eco-chic lunch hero! Crafted from durable 600D RPET polyester with a PEVA-lined, zippered main compartment, it keeps your meals fresh and stylish. Reinforced handles, adjustable strap, and sleek black details make on-the-go cooling a breeze. Cool, green, and ready!','Barron','GFT-14-AU','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Apron With Bbq Set','apron-with-bbq-set-bag-14-cr','Get ready to grill like a pro with Barron''s Apron With BBQ Set! Featuring durable stainless steel tools, a comfy 600D Oxford apron with foam padding, and a heat-resistant glove, this all-in-one braai kit amps up your BBQ game and keeps you stylish and protected all year round.','Barron','BAG-14-CR','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Printed Reversible Umbrella','printed-reversible-umbrella-gft-14-dr','Meet the Barron Printed Reversible Umbrella—your stylish shield against rain and wind! With a sturdy 210T Pongee fabric, windproof fibreglass frame, and sleek rubberized hook handle, it’s built for all-year outdoor adventures. Flip it inside out for double the fun and protection!','Barron','GFT-14-DR','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Voyage Wheeled Duffle','voyage-wheeled-duffle-bag-14-gx','Meet the Voyage Wheeled Duffle by Barron – your ultimate travel sidekick! Lightweight nylon/polyester, roomy compartments, and smooth trolley wheels make packing and rolling a breeze. Stylish, sturdy, and ready for any adventure – travel smarter, not harder!','Barron','BAG-14-GX','Minimum order quantity: 3','gifting'),('Snug 10000Mah Led Dig2 Pd Powerbank','snug-10000mah-led-dig2-pd-powerbank-gft-14-ir','Power up anywhere with the Snug 10000mAh LED Dig2 PD Powerbank! Fast PD charging, sleek LED display, and multiple ports mean your devices get juice up to 4 times—quick, easy, and on the go. Compact, lightweight, and ready to rock your tech life all year round!','Barron','GFT-14-IR','Minimum order quantity: 3','gifting'),('Burtone Mini Connect 2 Wireless Speaker','burtone-mini-connect-2-wireless-speaker-gft-14-ix','Unleash epic sound with the Burtone Mini Connect 2! Rock 20W deep bass, splash-proof IPX7, and 10-hour playtime. Pair two for double the party power. Bluetooth 5.0 keeps you connected—your ultimate all-year, all-occasion wireless speaker adventure awaits!','Barron','GFT-14-IX','Minimum order quantity: 2','gifting')) AS v(name,handle,description,brand,item,features,category_slug) JOIN public.shop_categories c ON c.slug=v.category_slug ON CONFLICT (handle) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,description=EXCLUDED.description,brand=EXCLUDED.brand,supplier_item_number=EXCLUDED.supplier_item_number,product_features=EXCLUDED.product_features,category_id=EXCLUDED.category_id,status=EXCLUDED.status;
