wer-bank-gft-15-8y','Power up anywhere with the Indestruktible IND 20,000mAh Power Bank! Featuring a handy 2-in-1 cable, clear 4-LED power display, and speedy USB outputs, it’s your ultimate all-year tech sidekick. Stay charged, stay unstoppable—because running out of juice is so last season!','Barron','GFT-15-8Y','Minimum order quantity: 3','gifting'),('IND Car Vent Mount Charger','ind-car-vent-mount-charger-gft-15-9c','Charge up on the go with the IND Car Vent Mount Charger! Sleek ABS design, fast Type-C USB charging, and a perfect 6mm hold keep your device powered and secure. Compact, bold, and ready for all-year tech adventures—drive smarter, charge faster!','Barron','GFT-15-9C','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('IND QI Fast Wireless Phone Charger 15 Watt Quick Charge','ind-qi-fast-wireless-phone-charger-15-watt-quick-charge-gft-15-9e','Power up in a flash with the IND QI Fast Wireless Charger! Sleek ABS and aluminum design delivers blazing 15W quick charge—no cords, no hassle. Just drop your phone and go! Perfect for tech lovers craving speed, style, and convenience all year round. Charge smarter, live bolder!','Barron','GFT-15-9E','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('IND Mouse Pad with 10W Fast Wireless Charging','ind-mouse-pad-with-10w-fast-wireless-charging-gft-15-9j','Power up while you work with the IND Mouse Pad by Indestruktible! This sleek, soft-touch pad charges your devices wirelessly at 10W lightning speed, keeps your mouse steady with a non-skid back, and comes with a handy USB-C cable. Charge smarter, play harder!','Barron','GFT-15-9J','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Stainless Steel Bottle & Mug Gift Set','stainless-steel-bottle-mug-gift-set-gft-16-al','Stay refreshed and stylish with Barron''s Stainless Steel Bottle & Ceramic Mug Gift Set! Sleek, durable, and perfect for all-year sips—500ml bottle keeps drinks fresh, while the 11oz ceramic mug brings cozy vibes. Gift greatness that’s as bold as your brew!','Barron','GFT-16-AL','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Cocktail Set Relien','cocktail-set-relien-gft-16-kc','Shake up your bartending game with the Barron Cocktail Set Relien! Stainless steel elegance meets ultimate functionality—complete with a sleek shaker, 2-in-1 measuring glass, mixer spoon, and filter. Packaged in a Limited Edition Experience case, it’s the perfect gift for cocktail lovers who crave style and precision!','Barron','GFT-16-KC','Minimum order quantity: 1','gifting'),('Power Station','power-station-gft-16-mh','Meet the Barron Power Station: your ultimate all-year lifesaver! With up to 25 hours of LED brilliance, dual charging options (AC & solar), USB mobile charging, and rugged ABS housing, it’s the bold, eco-friendly power buddy that keeps you shining and connected—anytime, anywhere!','Barron','GFT-16-MH','Minimum order quantity: 2','gifting'),('Amplify Athletic Series Smart Watch with Heart Rate Monitor','amplify-athletic-series-smart-watch-with-heart-rate-monitor-gft-17-vh','Meet the Amplify Athletic Series Smart Watch—your ultimate fitness sidekick! With a sleek single-point touch screen, real-time heart rate monitor, and 7-day standby, stay connected and energized all day. Charge fast, move freely, and never miss a beat or a call. Ready, set, amplify!','Amplify','GFT-17-VH','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Volkano Soul Series Smart Watch','volkano-soul-series-smart-watch-gft-18-fw','Unleash your vibe with the Volkano Soul Series Smart Watch! Bluetooth calls, heart rate tracking, 100+ sports modes, and a stunning 1.96 touch screen keep you connected, fit, and stylish—all day, every day. Ready for Apple or Android, it’s your ultimate tech sidekick!','Barron','GFT-18-FW','Minimum order quantity: 2','gifting'),('Volkano Sound Sweeper Active Noise Cancelling Headphones','volkano-sound-sweeper-active-noise-cancelling-headphones-gft-18-fx','Dive into pure sound bliss with Volkano Sound Sweeper Headphones! Featuring cutting-edge Active Noise Cancelling and Bluetooth 5.3, enjoy crystal-clear tunes with zero distractions and a reliable 10-meter range. Bold, sleek, and perfect for all—your ultimate audio adventure starts here!','Volkano','GFT-18-FX','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('2.0m Classic Parasol','2-0m-classic-parasol-gft-18-lf','Shade in style with the Barron 2.0m Classic Parasol! Its sturdy 4-panel, windproof design and UV-coated fabric keep you cool and protected all year. Perfect for any outdoor adventure—just add the 25kg base and enjoy unbeatable sun defense with bold, classic flair!','Barron','GFT-18-LF','Minimum order quantity: 1','gifting'),('High Capacity Powerbank 11000 mAh','high-capacity-powerbank-11000-mah-gft-08-fw','Power up your adventures with Barron''s High Capacity 11000 mAh Powerbank! Dual output means double the charge, while the sleek battery indicator keeps you in control. Compact, solid color, and ready to fuel your devices anywhere—stay unstoppable all year long!','Barron','GFT-08-FW','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('2 Person Picnic Set and Cooler','2-person-picnic-set-and-cooler-gft-08-at','Meet the Barron 2 Person Picnic Set and Cooler—your ultimate outdoor sidekick! Crafted with durable 600D nylon, it packs plates, cutlery, wine glasses, and more into a sleek cooler with mesh pockets and a comfy shoulder strap. Picnic perfection, anytime, anywhere!','Barron','GFT-08-AT','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('500ml Moltex Bottle','500ml-moltex-bottle-gft-06-no','Meet the 500ml Moltex Bottle by Barron — your eco-chic hydration hero! With a sleek bamboo body and stainless steel interior, it keeps drinks fresh and stylish. Packaged in a classy box, it’s the perfect gift that’s as kind to the planet as it is to your taste buds. Sip sustainably!','Barron','GFT-06-NO','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('770ml Anukin 770ml Bottle','770ml-anukin-770ml-bottle-gft-06-oj','Stay hydrated in style with the Barron Anukin 770ml Bottle! Crafted from durable stainless steel with a sleek cork-inspired lid, it’s eco-friendly, spacious, and perfect for on-the-go adventures. Presented in a chic eco box, it’s the ultimate gift that’s as bold as you are!','Barron','GFT-06-OJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Kalery Wireless Power Bank 6000 mAh','kalery-wireless-power-bank-6000-mah-gft-13-ec','Power up your adventures with the Barron Kalery Wireless Power Bank! Bamboo-crafted, ultra-compact, and boasting 6000mAh, it wirelessly charges on the go. Dual USB outputs, Type C, and Micro USB inputs keep you connected everywhere—cable included. Eco-chic power, anytime, anywhere!','Barron','GFT-13-EC','Minimum order quantity: 3','gifting'),('750ml Bottle Rekka','750ml-bottle-rekka-gft-14-af','Meet the Barron 750ml Rekka Bottle: sleek stainless steel with a chic cork band and safety screw cap. Stylish, eco-friendly, and durable—perfect for staying hydrated in bold style all year round. Gift it, flaunt it, love it!','Barron','GFT-14-AF','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Zen Hiking Backpack','zen-hiking-backpack-bag-14-co','Meet the Zen Hiking Backpack by Barron—your bold, all-year outdoor sidekick! With roomy zippered compartments, comfy waist & sternum straps, and tough polyester build, it hauls up to 20kg with ease. Stay organized, secure, and ready for adventure—gear up and conquer the wild in style!','Barron','BAG-14-CO','Minimum order quantity: 2','gifting'),('Outlander Hiking Backpack','outlander-hiking-backpack-bag-14-cp','Meet the Outlander Hiking Backpack by Barron—your ultimate outdoor sidekick! With roomy compartments, comfy padded handles, and a tough 20kg capacity, it’s built for adventure. Stay organized with mesh pockets and compression straps, while the removable waist belt keeps you light on your feet. Ready, set, explore!','Barron','BAG-14-CP','Minimum order quantity: 3','gifting'),('Burtone Portable Wireless Speaker','burtone-portable-wireless-speaker-gft-14-iz','Unleash epic sound everywhere with the Burtone Portable Wireless Speaker! Rock out with 4W power, 6-hour playtime, and four versatile modes—Bluetooth, AUX, Micro SD, and USB. Pair two for double the fun. Strap it, grab it, and elevate your music game anytime, anywhere!','Barron','GFT-14-IZ','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('IND Luminous Bluetooth Headphone','ind-luminous-bluetooth-headphone-gft-15-8f','Get ready to rock with IND Luminous Bluetooth Headphones! Featuring crisp Bluetooth 5.2 sound, FM radio, and a built-in mic, these bold, comfy headphones charge fast in just 2 hours via USB. Perfect for nonstop tunes and calls—your ultimate tech companion all year round!','Barron','GFT-15-8F','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('IND Active Noise Cancelling Bluetooth Headphone','ind-active-noise-cancelling-bluetooth-headphone-gft-15-8g','Dive into pure sound bliss with Indestruktible’s IND Active Noise Cancelling Bluetooth Headphones! Wireless freedom, 10m Bluetooth range, and powerful 400mAh battery keep your tunes uninterrupted. Crafted with sleek ABS and PU, these headphones turn every moment into an epic audio adventure. Ready to rock your world!','Barron','GFT-15-8G','Minimum order quantity: 3','gifting'),('IND Mini Portable Bluetooth Speaker','ind-mini-portable-bluetooth-speaker-gft-15-8i','Unleash epic sound anywhere with the IND Mini Portable Bluetooth Speaker! Splash-proof IPX4, dazzling RGB lights, and phone call-ready fun make every moment pop. Stream via Bluetooth, AUX, or Micro SD—your ultimate party sidekick with a 10m range and speedy 3-4 hour charge!','Barron','GFT-15-8I','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Zee Portable Speaker','zee-portable-speaker-gft-15-8j','Meet the Zee Portable Speaker by Indestruktible—your ultimate music sidekick! With Bluetooth, FM radio, USB, Micro SD, and aux inputs, plus 4-hour charge for up to 4 hours of booming 12W sound, it’s your all-year, all-occasion party starter. Plug in, play loud, and own the vibe!','Barron','GFT-15-8J','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('