you go!','Amplify','GFT-17-VP','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Amplify NoteX Series True Wireless Earphones + Charging Case','amplify-notex-series-true-wireless-earphones-charging-case-gft-17-vr','Unleash freedom with Amplify NoteX True Wireless Earphones! Enjoy 14 hours of epic sound, seamless Bluetooth 5.0, and touch controls. Hands-free calls and a sleek silicone hook keep you moving all day. Bold sound, zero wires—your ultimate audio sidekick!','Amplify','GFT-17-VR','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Amplify Tuner Series Bluetooth Radio Speaker','amplify-tuner-series-bluetooth-radio-speaker-gft-17-vy','Unleash your sound with the Amplify Tuner Series Bluetooth Radio Speaker! Enjoy wireless Bluetooth, USB, Aux, Micro SD, and FM radio with auto scanning. Switch between Classic, Jazz, and Pop EQ modes for perfect vibes. Rechargeable with 6 hours playtime—music freedom wherever you go!','Amplify','GFT-17-VY','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Volcano Punch Series 20000 mAh Power Bank','volcano-punch-series-20000-mah-power-bank-gft-18-dm','Meet the Volkano Volcano Punch 20000mAh Power Bank – your pocket-sized powerhouse! Fast, versatile charging with multiple ports, LED display, and built-in safety. Stay unstoppable all day, every day. Charge smarter, live bolder!','Barron','GFT-18-DM','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Volkano Pisces Series 2.0 True Wireless Earphones','volkano-pisces-series-2-0-true-wireless-earphones-gft-18-fb','Dive into endless beats with Volkano Pisces Series 2.0! True wireless freedom, Bluetooth magic, and sweat-proof durability keep you jamming all day, rain or shine. Elevate your sound game—comfort, style, and nonstop playback in one sleek package. Ready to rock your world? Grab yours now!','Barron','GFT-18-FB','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Volkano Retro Series Portable Vinyl Player','volkano-retro-series-portable-vinyl-player-gft-18-fk','Spin your favorite tunes anywhere with the Volkano Retro Series Portable Vinyl Player! This stylish, compact wonder features 3 speed modes, built-in FM radio, and lets you record tracks to USB or SD card. Retro vibes meet modern convenience—your ultimate music companion on the go!','Volkano','GFT-18-FK','Minimum order quantity: 1','gifting'),('Volkano Scorpio Series True Wireless Earphones','volkano-scorpio-series-true-wireless-earphones-gft-18-fr','Unleash freedom with Volkano Scorpio True Wireless Earphones! Enjoy 24 hours of epic sound, touch control magic, and splash-proof IPX4 durability. Chat with Siri or Google Assistant hands-free—perfect for unstoppable, all-year tech lovers. Bold sound, bold style, zero wires!','Barron','GFT-18-FR','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Volkano Sleek Series True Wireless Earphones','volkano-sleek-series-true-wireless-earphones-gft-18-fv','Experience freedom with Volkano Sleek Series True Wireless Earphones! Bluetooth-powered, quick 2-hour charging, and sleek design make every beat bold and hassle-free. Perfect for all-year tech lovers—unleash your sound without limits and elevate your audio game effortlessly!','Barron','GFT-18-FV','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('Volkano Stun Series Bluetooth Speaker','volkano-stun-series-bluetooth-speaker-gft-18-gg','Unleash your tunes with the Volkano Stun Series Bluetooth Speaker! Booming 10W power, SD/USB inputs, FM radio, and aux support keep the party rolling anywhere, anytime. Compact, bold, and ready to stun—your ultimate sound sidekick for all-year fun!','Volkano','GFT-18-GG','Minimum order quantity: 5','gifting'),('VolkanoX Adder Series Bluetooth Speaker','volkanox-adder-series-bluetooth-speaker-gft-18-hl','Unleash epic sound with the VolkanoX Adder Series Bluetooth Speaker! Rock up to 8 hours, splash-proof IPx5, dazzling LED lights, and versatile inputs—Bluetooth, AUX, SD card. Plus, charge your devices on the go with a powerbank output. Party smarter, louder, and wetter!','Barron','GFT-18-HL','Minimum order quantity: 1','gifting'),(