and safe—on or off the field. Now in kiddie sizes too, for champs of all ages!','BRT Range','SPO-10-ZL','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Hydro Golfer','brt-hydro-golfer-spo-10-zr','Meet the BRT Hydro Golfer: your all-year, breathable golf shirt with raglan sleeves, contrast mesh panels, and moisture-wicking polyester. Stay cool, stylish, and visible with reflective prints—perfect for every swing, on or off the course. Now in kid sizes too! Game on, rain or shine!','BRT Range','SPO-10-ZR','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Econo Tracksuit','brt-econo-tracksuit-spo-10-yr','Get moving in the BRT Econo Tracksuit—where comfort meets style! With cozy polyester, tapered legs, and handy side pockets, it’s your all-year, sporty sidekick. Elastic drawcords ensure the perfect fit, while bold contrast shoulders keep you looking sharp. Ready, set, slay every workout!','BRT Range','SPO-10-YR','Minimum order quantity: 2','sport'),('BRT Champion Tracksuit Top','brt-champion-tracksuit-top-spo-10-zm','Unleash your sporty side with the BRT Champion Tracksuit Top! Crafted from breathable 100% tricot polyester, it offers a comfort fit, stylish contrast panels, and handy inseam pockets—perfect for all-year action. Elevate your game with bold style and unbeatable comfort!','BRT Range','SPO-10-ZM','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Blade Soccer Single Set','brt-blade-soccer-single-set-spo-11-ax','Unleash your game with the BRT Blade Soccer Single Set! Featuring quick-dry X-tech fabric, comfy elastic waistband, and bold contrast mesh inserts, this set keeps you cool, dry, and stylish on the field. Ready to dominate? Gear up and play like a pro—no numbering, just pure performance!','Barron','SPO-11-AX','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Hydro Tracksuit Top','brt-hydro-tracksuit-top-spo-10-zu','Unleash your sporty side with the BRT Hydro Tracksuit Top! Featuring raglan sleeves, breathable mesh panels, and reflective details, it’s built for comfort, style, and