l zip, secure zip pockets, and bold Flex CCC logo—perfect for sport or street, all year round. Elevate your game and style effortlessly!','Barron','JAC-18-QK','Minimum order quantity: 1','sport'),('BRT Balance Lightweight Sweatshirt','brt-balance-lightweight-sweatshirt-spo-11-ao','Meet the BRT Balance Lightweight Sweatshirt — your new sporty sidekick! Ultra-soft, breathable mesh panels and a sleek funnel collar keep you cool and stylish. Reflective details and thumb holes? Yes, please! Lightweight comfort meets bold design for off-field wins every time. Ready, set, balance!','Barron','SPO-11-AO','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('Canterbury Team Dry Polo Snr Mens','canterbury-team-dry-polo-snr-mens-glf-18-qf','Stay cool, dry, and unstoppable in the Canterbury Team Dry Polo! With Vapodri moisture-wicking tech, synthetic piped details, and offset seams for zero chafing, this 100% polyester powerhouse keeps you comfy and moving freely—perfect for crushing it on the field all year round!','Barron','GLF-18-QF','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('Canterbury Pro Hoody','canterbury-pro-hoody-spo-18-qs','Gear up with the Canterbury Pro Hoody—your ultimate all-year sport companion! Its cozy funnel-neck hood and comfy cuffs shield you from the chill, while the sleek pouch pocket keeps essentials close. Crafted from durable polyester-Lycra twill, it’s bold, breathable, and built for action!','Barron','SPO-18-QS','Minimum order quantity: 2','sport'),('BRT Pro Reflect Bag','brt-pro-reflect-bag-bag-11-ff','Meet the BRT Pro Reflect Bag—your ultimate sport companion! Crafted from durable 600D nylon with reflective piping for safety, it boasts 2 zippered side pockets, plastic feet, and branded straps. Stylish, sturdy, and spacious (60x31x32cm), it’s built to elevate every game day!','Barron','BAG-11-FF','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Reflect Back Pack','brt-reflect-back-pack-bag-11-fg','Meet the BRT Reflect Back Pack: sporty, sleek, and super comfy! With 3 zippered pockets, reflective piping for safety, and padded back support, this 600D nylon marvel keeps your gear secure and you visible—day or night. Adjustable straps? Check. Ready for all your adventures!','Barron','BAG-11-FG','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Reflect Golfer Mens','brt-reflect-golfer-mens-spo-10-yh','Elevate your game with the BRT Reflect Golfer Mens shirt! Featuring quick-dry X-tech fabric, comfy raglan sleeves, and sleek reflective piping, it’s designed for all-day comfort and standout style on and off the course. Ready to play hard and look sharp? This is your new go-to!','BRT Range','SPO-10-YH','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Motion Dress','brt-motion-dress-spo-11-bu','Unleash your game with the BRT Motion Dress! Featuring moisture-wicking polyester, a comfy feminine fit, and bold contrast stitching, it’s designed for all-day comfort and style on the netball court. Proudly South African, adjustable hem included—play hard, look fierce!','Barron','SPO-11-BU','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Signature Long Sleeve Top Ladies','brt-signature-long-sleeve-top-ladies-spo-10-ym','Unleash your sporty side with the BRT Signature Long Sleeve Top! Featuring breathable polyester-spandex fabric, thumb-hole cuffs, and bold contrast stitching, it keeps you comfy and stylish on and off the field. Rock the sleek extended back hem and standout charcoal melange—performance meets fierce fashion!','BRT Range','SPO-10-YM','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Zone Jacket','brt-zone-jacket-spo-10-yp','Meet the BRT Zone Jacket – your ultimate winter sport companion! With quick-dry X-Tech fabric, zippered pockets, and a hidden hood, it’s built for comfort, style, and performance. Stay dry, cozy, and ready to conquer every adventure with bold BRT flair!','Barron','SPO-10-YP','Minimum order quantity: 3','sport'),('BRT Crossover Jogger Mens','brt-crossover-jogger-mens-spo-10-zz','Step up your game with BRT Crossover Jogger Mens! Crafted from cozy 240g brushed fleece, these sporty tracksuit pants boast a comfort fit, elastic waistband with drawcord, and handy side pockets. Rock BRT’s high-quality finish all year round—style and comfort, no sweat!','BRT Range','SPO-10-ZZ','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Chrome Tog Bag','brt-chrome-tog-bag-bag-11-gd','Meet the BRT Chrome Tog Bag: your sporty sidekick with rugged 600D polyester, zippered pockets for flawless organization, and reflective piping for safety. Rock branded straps and a tough base with plastic feet—durability and style that keep up with your game! Ready, set, shine!','Barron','BAG-11-GD','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Balance Hoody','brt-balance-hoody-spo-11-ap','Meet the BRT Balance Hoody: your winter sport sidekick! Crafted from cozy 250g brushed polyester, it boasts contrast panels, a chunky drawcord, and sleek high-low hem for style and warmth. Stay comfy, look bold, and conquer every chilly adventure with BRT Range’s standout design!','Barron','SPO-11-AP','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Crossover Jogger Ladies','brt-crossover-jogger-ladies-spo-11-av','Step up your game with BRT Crossover Jogger Ladies—cotton-rich comfort, sleek slanted pockets, and a snug elastic waistband. Perfect for sport or chill, these joggers blend style and ease all year round. Feel bold, move freely, and rock that comfort fit like a champ!','BRT Range','SPO-11-AV','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Easy-Fit Tracksuit','brt-easy-fit-tracksuit-spo-15-6b','Step up your game with the BRT Easy-Fit Tracksuit! Featuring comfy raglan sleeves, handy side pockets, and eye-catching reflective prints, it’s crafted from durable mini rip-stop polyester for all-year comfort and style. Perfect fit, bold branding—your ultimate off-field companion!','Barron','SPO-15-6B','Minimum order quantity: 2','sport'),('BRT Pakari Rugby Jersey II','brt-pakari-rugby-jersey-ii-spo-16-yj','Unleash your game with the BRT Pakari Rugby Jersey II! Rock its bold V-shaped collar, durable 13 bar-tacks, and moisture-wicking polyester for unbeatable comfort and strength. Designed for champions who demand style, durability, and peak performance—every match, all year round!','Barron','SPO-16-YJ','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('240g Unbrushed Fleece Pullover Hoody','240g-unbrushed-fleece-pullover-hoody-eve-18-jl','Get cozy and bold with the Barron 240g Unbrushed Fleece Pullover Hoody! Crafted from 100% cotton, it boasts a comfy easy fit, ribbed cuffs, and a front pocket. Rock the “Stronger Together” vibe and official Springboks logo—perfect for sporty style all year round!','Barron','EVE-18-JL','Minimum order quantity: 3','sport'),('Canterbury Tapered Pants','canterbury-tapered-pants-spo-18-qt','Step up your game with Canterbury Tapered Pants! Slim-fit, comfy polyester with side zips and pockets—perfect for workouts or chill days. Elastic waistband and drawcord keep you snug, while the iconic embroidered logo adds style. Sporty, sleek, and ready for action all year round!','Barron','SPO-18-QT','Minimum order quantity: 2','sport'),('BRT Teamster Cricket Shirt','brt-teamster-cricket-shirt-spo-11-bd','Step onto the pitch in the BRT Teamster Cricket Shirt—where comfort meets performance! Featuring quick-dry X-Tech fabric, breathable mesh inserts, and a sleek self-fabric collar, this proudly South African gem keeps you cool, sharp, and ready to conquer every game. Play bold, play local!','Barron','SPO-11-BD','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Crossover Short','brt-crossover-short-spo-10-zg','Unleash your sporty side with BRT Crossover Shorts! Crafted from cozy 220g cotton-polyester fleece, featuring comfy elastic waistband, handy side pockets, and a sleek finish—designed for all-year comfort and style. Ready to elevate your game? These shorts bring bold comfort on and off the field!','Barron','SPO-10-ZG','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('BRT Cool Dry Jacket','brt-cool-dry-jacket-spo-16-yi','Meet the BRT Cool Dry Jacket by Barron—your sporty sidekick with breathable polyester, an all-in-one collar and hood, reflective prints, and handy bungee drawcord. Stay cool, dry, and stylish all year round while conquering any adventure with ease and flair!','Barron','SPO-16-YI','Minimum order quantity: 3','sport'),('160g Single Jersey Short Sleeve Golfer','160g-single-jersey-short-sleeve-golfer-eve-18-jm','Score style and comfort with the Barron 160g Single Jersey Short Sleeve Golfer! Featuring a classic 3-button placket, breathable 100% cotton, and iconic Springboks embroidery, this regular-fit tee keeps you cool and sporty all year round. Local pride meets unbeatable comfort—game on!','Barron','EVE-18-JM','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('Canterbury Team Full Zip Rain Jacket','canterbury-team-full-zip-rain-jacket-jac-18-ql','Stay dry in style with the Canterbury Team Full Zip Rain Jacket! Lightweight, water-repellent polyester keeps you comfy, while the concealed hood and zip pockets add sleek functionality. Sporty, bold, and ready for any weather—this jacket is your ultimate all-year game changer!','Barron','JAC-18-QL','Minimum order quantity: 2','sport'),('Canterbury Team Dry Tee Snr Mens','canterbury-team-dry-tee-snr-mens-tst-18-qz','Stay cool and unstoppable in the Canterbury Team Dry Tee! With Vapodri moisture-wicking tech, synthetic piped details, and offset seams for zero chafing, this 100% polyester powerhouse keeps you dry, comfy, and game-ready all year long. Elevate your sport style and performance now!','Barron','TST-18-QZ','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('Canterbury Kiwi Golfer','canterbury-kiwi-golfer-glf-18-qh','Step up your game with the Canterbury Kiwi Golfer! Crafted from a soft poly-cotton blend, it offers unbeatable comfort, stylish contrast placket, and ribbed collar for a sleek look. Move freely with side vents and show off the iconic embroidered logo—your perfect sporty companion all year round!','Barron','GLF-18-QH','Minimum order quantity: 3','sport'),('Canterbury Side Panel Polo','canterbury-side-panel-polo-glf-18-qg','Step up your game with the Canterbury Side Panel Polo! Moisture-wicking magic keeps you cool, while bold contrast piping and offset seams deliver style and comfort. Perfect for all-year sport, this 100% polyester powerhouse means fresh, fearless performance every time!','Barron','GLF-18-QG','Minimum order quantity: 5','sport'),('Mens Golf Shirt Custom Design','mens-golf-shirt-custom-design-sub-12-du','Tee off in style with Barron Sublimation’s Mens Golf Shirt! Choose your fabric, rock a sleek self-fabric collar, and flaunt custom sublimated designs that scream YOU. Lightweight, breathable polyester means comfort meets bold flair—perfect for turning heads on and off the green!','Barron Sublimation','SUB-12-DU','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Mens Long Sleeve T-Shirt Custom Design','mens-long-sleeve-t-shirt-custom-design-sub-12-gb','Unleash your style with Barron Sublimation’s Mens Long Sleeve T-Shirt! Crafted from comfy polyester with a sleek crew neck and vibrant sublimated designs—customize your look or pick a pre-made fave. Perfect for all-year wear, this tee brings bold, lasting comfort to your wardrobe!','Barron Sublimation','SUB-12-GB','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Ladies Crew Neck T-shirt Custom Design','ladies-crew-neck-t-shirt-custom-design-sub-11-yc','Unleash your style with Barron Sublimation’s Ladies Crew Neck T-shirt! Choose from vibrant sublimated designs or create your own on comfy, breathable polyester. Perfect fit, bold colors, and quick turnaround—custom fashion made fun, fresh, and totally YOU! Ready to rock your look all year round?','Barron Sublimation','SUB-11-YC','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Kiddies V-Neck T-Shirt Custom Design','kiddies-v-neck-t-shirt-custom-design-sub-11-xe','Unleash creativity with Barron Sublimation’s Kiddies V-Neck T-Shirt! Choose vibrant, comfy polyester fabrics and top it off with a stylish V-neckline. Perfect for custom designs that pop—make your kid’s style truly one-of-a-kind. Ready to rock all year round with quick turnaround and endless fun!','Barron Sublimation','SUB-11-XE','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Kiddies Golf Shirt Custom Design','kiddies-golf-shirt-custom-design-sub-11-uo','Swing into style with Barron Sublimation’s Kiddies Golf Shirt! Made from comfy, breathable polyester with a sleek self-fabric collar and vibrant sublimated designs, it’s perfect for all-year fun. Customize your look and tee off with confidence—because ordinary golf shirts just aren’t your kid’s style!','Barron Sublimation','SUB-11-UO','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Ladies V-Neck Vest Custom Design','ladies-v-neck-vest-custom-design-sub-12-bq','Unleash your style with Barron Sublimation’s Ladies V-Neck Vest! Choose from vibrant sublimated fabrics or create your own bold design. Lightweight, comfy polyester with a sleek V-neck and flawless finish—perfect for any season. Stand out, stay cool, and rock your custom look effortlessly!','Barron Sublimation','SUB-12-BQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Cycling Top Custom Design','cycling-top-custom-design-sub-11-su','Unleash your ride with Barron Sublimation’s Cycling Top! Featuring raglan sleeves, elasticated high-low hem, and 3 pouch back pockets, this custom sublimated polyester gem delivers comfort, style, and functionality all year round. Choose your perfect fabric and race ahead in bold, breathable gear!','Barron Sublimation','SUB-11-SU','Minimum order quantity: 5','sublimation-cat'),('Mens V-Neck T-Shirt Custom Design','mens-v-neck-t-shirt-custom-design-sub-12-gp','Unleash your style with Barron Sublimation’s Mens V-Neck T-Shirt! Choose from vibrant sublimated designs or create your own. Crafted from breathable polyester with a sleek V-neck and flawless stitching, it’s comfort and creativity combined—perfect for making bold, custom statements all year round!','Barron Sublimatio