 works as hard as you do!','Barron','HVI-13-FY','Minimum order quantity: 3','work-wear'),('Two Tone Ground Zero Jacket','two-tone-ground-zero-jacket-con-13-ge','Meet the Two Tone Ground Zero Jacket by Barron—your ultimate cold-weather warrior! Insulated, water-resistant, and loaded with reflective tape for all-day visibility, it’s built tough with durable polyester and smart pockets. Stay warm, dry, and seen—workwear that means business, proudly South African!','Barron','CON-13-GE','Minimum order quantity: 3','work-wear'),('Grittgear Medicate Clog','grittgear-medicate-clog-fwr-19-kk','Step into the Grittgear Medicate Clog by Barron—ultra-light, shock-absorbing, and waterproof! Stay comfy, clean, and safe with anti-slip, oil-resistant soles and antibacterial socks. Perfect for long shifts in food, healthcare, or labs—your feet’s new best friend all year round!','Barron','FWR-19-KK','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('Patrol Golfer','patrol-golfer-hvi-11-lu','Step up your safety game with the Barron Patrol Golfer! This high-vis, durable golf shirt boasts reflective tape for day-night visibility, a comfy cotton-poly blend, and a sharp striped collar. Perfect for construction pros and security heroes who demand style and protection all year round!','Barron','HVI-11-LU','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Barron Canvas Lace Up Shoe','barron-canvas-lace-up-shoe-fwr-11-kc','Step into comfort and safety with the Barron Canvas Lace Up Shoe! Featuring slip-resistant soles, a tough rubberised toe cap, and breathable 100% cotton canvas, these unisex kicks keep you secure and stylish all day—perfect for work or casual wear. Durable, comfy, and ready to roll!','Barron','FWR-11-KC','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Barron Budget 100% Cotton Conti Suit with Reflective','barron-budget-100-cotton-conti-suit-with-reflective-con-11-ov','Meet the Barron Budget Conti Suit—tough 100% cotton denim with reflective tape on elbows and knees for safety and style. Triple-stitched durability, comfy elastic waistband, and sleek concealed zips make workwear that works as hard as you do. Proudly South African, built to last!','Barron','CON-11-OV','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Work Wear Belt','work-wear-belt-saf-11-qf','Meet the Barron Work Wear Belt—tough leather, adjustable rivets for the perfect fit, and a sleek metal buckle. Proudly South African, this belt combines durability with style, making your uniform pop all year round. Ready to work hard? So is your belt!','Barron','SAF-11-QF','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Sebenza Service Top','sebenza-service-top-gft-11-ru','Step up your workwear game with the Sebenza Service Top by Barron! Featuring bold contrast shwe shwe accents, comfy side slits, and durable poly-cotton fabric, it’s made for all-day ease and style—proudly South African and perfect for the food industry hustle.','Barron','GFT-11-RU','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Tyson Jacket','tyson-jacket-hvi-11-nk','Meet the Tyson Jacket by Barron: your all-year, high-visibility hero! Rock bold two-tone style with reflective tape, stay cozy with quilted padding, and enjoy handy front pockets. Polyester-coated for durability and elastic cuffs for the perfect fit—workwear that works as hard as you do!','Barron','HVI-11-NK','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('Alaska Freezer Pants','alaska-freezer-pants-con-13-gd','Stay warm and tough in Barron’s Alaska Freezer Pants! Insulated, water-resistant, and built to last with double top-stitching—these heavyweight polyester trousers are your ultimate defense against the chill. Proudly South African, they keep you cozy and protected all year long. Work smart, stay cool!','Barron','CON-13-GD','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('JCB Technical Work Trouser','jcb-technical-work-trouser-jcb-16-ed','Gear up with JCB Technical Work Trousers—tough 215gsm fabric, knee panels with Velcro pockets, and utility holsters! Designed for all-day comfort and durability, they make kneeling and climbing a breeze. Reflective branding adds safety and style. Work smart, work bold with JCB!','Barron','JCB-16-ED','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('JCB Legacy Chelsea Boot','jcb-legacy-chelsea-boot-jcb-16-em','Step into unstoppable style and comfort with the JCB Legacy Chelsea Boot! Crafted from rugged full-grain leather with ultra-grip soles and a soft toe, these slip-ons deliver all-day durability and ease. Work hard, look sharp, and conquer every step—your ultimate uniform upgrade!','Barron','JCB-16-EM','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('Barron Stretch Work Wear Jean','barron-stretch-work-wear-jean-bot-16-eq','Meet the Barron Stretch Work Wear Jean—your all-day comfort hero! With stretch fabric, durable riveted pockets, and sleek tonal stitching, these jeans flex with you while keeping style sharp. Perfect for work or play, they’re the ultimate blend of toughness and comfort. Ready to move? You bet!','Barron','BOT-16-EQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Barron Imvula Rainsuit','barron-imvula-rainsuit-co-16-zc','Stay dry and unstoppable with the Barron Imvula Rainsuit! This water-resistant, unisex workwear is your all-year outdoor hero—local quality that keeps you protected and comfortable, rain or shine. Gear up boldly and conquer every storm with style and confidence!','Barron','CO-16-ZC','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('Barron Long Sleeve Reflective Golfer With Tape','barron-long-sleeve-reflective-golfer-with-tape-hvi-18-jq','Stand out day or night with Barron''s Long Sleeve Reflective Golfer! Lightweight, breathable, and decked with reflective tape, it’s your ultimate high-visibility workwear. Perfect for safety pros craving comfort, style, and serious visibility—because safety never goes out of fashion!','Barron','HVI-18-JQ','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Barron Veldskoen','barron-veldskoen-fwr-18-xn','Step into all-year comfort and style with Barron Veldskoen! These unisex work shoes blend durability and versatility, making every step bold and confident. Ready to tackle any job, they’re your ultimate go-to footwear for unstoppable performance and standout cool.','Barron','FWR-18-XN','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('All-Purpose Short Sleeve Lab Coat','all-purpose-short-sleeve-lab-coat-gft-11-rr','Meet the Barron All-Purpose Short Sleeve Lab Coat—your stylish, durable sidekick! With comfy poly-cotton fabric, handy pockets, and a sleek concealed front, it’s perfect for any profession. Proudly South African and built to work as hard as you do, all year round!','Barron','GFT-11-RR','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('Two Tone Ground Zero Pants','two-tone-ground-zero-pants-con-13-gf','Meet the Two Tone Ground Zero Pants by Barron—your ultimate all-year, outdoor workwear! Insulated, water-resistant, and hi-vis for day and night safety, these tough, comfy trousers keep you warm and visible. Adjustable elastic waist means perfect fit, proudly South African and built to last!','Barron','CON-13-GF','Minimum order quantity: 5','work-wear'),('JCB Windbreaker','jcb-windbreaker-jcb-16-ei','Meet the JCB Windbreaker: your all-year, water & wind-resistant workwear hero! With hi-reflective neon fabric and concealed chest zipper pocket, it’s bold, comfy, and built to keep you visible and protected. Easy fit, tough fabric—work smart, shine bright!','Barron','JCB-16-EI','Minimum order quantity: 2','work-wear'),('Barron 6 Level Shoe Display Stand','barron-6-level-shoe-display-stand-fwr-18-yg','Showcase your kicks like a pro with the Barron 6 Level Shoe Display Stand! Six double-sided shelves offer a stunning 3D view, perfectly cut to size for max impact. Elevate your shoe game and organize with flair—because your footwear deserves the spotlight all year round!','Barron','FWR-18-YG','Minimum order quantity: 1','work-wear'),('Veldskoen Chukka','veldskoen-chukka-vdn-19-sm','nan','Veldskoen','VDN-19-SM','Minimum order quantity: 1','work-wear'),('Veldskoen Classic','veldskoen-classic-vdn-19-sn','nan','Veldskoen','VDN-19-SN','Minimum order quantity: 1','work-wear')) AS v(name,handle,description,brand,item,features,category_slug) JOIN public.shop_categories c ON c.slug=v.category_slug ON CONFLICT (handle) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,description=EXCLUDED.description,brand=EXCLUDED.brand,supplier_item_number=EXCLUDED.supplier_item_number,product_features=EXCLUDED.product_features,category_id=EXCLUDED.category_id,status=EXCLUDED.status;
